('REV001EMP001','EMP001','Asiegbu Chioma John','Marketing 2 (Marketing Executive & CSR)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','I maintained strong client relationships by responding promptly to inquiries, resolving complaints, following up on customers, and supporting marketing activities that contributed to customer satisfaction, awareness and business growth.\ni ensured i kept accurate trip and payment records.\ni supported marketing campaigns for new era transport and skill up\ni ensured our drivers are of good conduct, and they are treated right by our client.','\nShe has been performing satisfactorily but needs to take greater ownership of her responsibilities and strengthen her job execution.','The employee has performed satisfactorily during the review period. The improvement plans shared are encouraging and align with the role. HR encourages the employee to take greater ownership of responsibilities, improve execution, and continue developing the skills needed to deliver better results.',7.829999999999999,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_MARKETING_7\",\"text\":\"Customer Satisfaction & Inquiry Management\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Marketing 2 (Marketing Executive & CSR)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain customer satisfaction rating of 85–90% or higher (where feedback is collected)\",\"Ensure 100% accurate logging of customer enquiries and leads\",\"Support generation of qualified leads through marketing interactions and follow-ups\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Mr. Raheem\\t0703 568 6591 \\tIt was a nice trip, and your pilot made our lives so easy, we will surely come back for better collaboration.\\n\",\"managerScore\":70},{\"id\":\"OBJ_MARKETING_8\",\"text\":\"Client Communications Quality\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Marketing 2 (Marketing Executive & CSR)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain professional and courteous communication with all customers\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"miss Justina 0703 284 3282 was angry with the sales closer for delay in sending drivers contact, i stepped in with this message and calmed the situations. 10th july 2026\\nGood afternoon ma, \\nI\'m chioma from New Era Transport,\\nI will be sending you drivers contact shortly, thank you for trusting new era with your trip.\\n\",\"managerScore\":70},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"During the drivers training i talked to them about their hygiene and professional communication\",\"managerScore\":3},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Before jamb started i took it upon myself to share the flier at Alakija, during Jamb i also spoke to parents about skill up and for summer camp.\",\"managerScore\":3},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I keep a good repot with my colleagues and I pass my information clearly to everyone.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I have and will always be committed to my work and I\'m always at work.\\n\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"i have been following my KPI righteously and even doing my personal marketing \",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"i watch YouTube and Instagram clips \",\"managerScore\":2}]','2026-07-17 12:42:55.000','i will enhance my customer service and digital marketing skills through training.\ni  will strengthen collaboration with the operations team, workshop team for efficient service delivery.\ni will continue to support marketing efforts to generate more leads and retain clients.\ncontinuously improve customer satisfaction through timely communication and follow-up.\ni will continuously educate the drivers on the importance of good hygiene and professional conduct.'),
('REV001EMP002','EMP002','Saheed Akanbi Yusuf','Fleet 4 (Facility Manager)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','I make sure I put in my best to any job assigned to me,do routine checks within the premises to see if there is any lapses we need to urgently work on with a long lasting solutions ...','He\'s very active in carrying out activities, but needs improvement in reporting. and report sharing on data base 90%.','The employee has shown commitment and a proactive approach to assigned responsibilities. HR encourages improvement in timely reporting and proper documentation by ensuring reports are consistently shared and updated on the database. The suggestion regarding having a standby electrician is noted as a practical recommendation to improve response time for maintenance issues. Continued focus on both execution and reporting will enhance overall performance.',9.065249999999999,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_10\",\"text\":\"Facility Functionality & Uptime\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 4 (Facility Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain at least 95% operational uptime of all critical facility systems (electricity supply, generators, water systems, air-conditioning, and lighting)\",\"Ensure all facility faults are logged and addressed within 24–48 hours of reporting\",\"Keep facility-related operational disruptions below 5% per quarter\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"He has  been performing excellently\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_11\",\"text\":\"Preventive Maintenance Compliance\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 4 (Facility Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain accurate maintenance records for all facility equipment\",\"Reduce emergency maintenance incidents by at least 20% annually through preventive maintenance planning\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"he reduces risk to bearing minimum.\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_12\",\"text\":\"Repair Response Time\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 4 (Facility Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure minor repairs are resolved within 24 hours and major repairs within 72 hours where feasible\",\"Maintain at least 90% on-time completion rate for repair requests\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"Very accurate and timely.\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_13\",\"text\":\"Facility Cost & Resource Management\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 4 (Facility Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain facility expenses within approved operational budgets each quarter\",\"Achieve 5–10% annual improvement in utility efficiency (electricity, water, fuel usage) through monitoring and optimization\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"he reduces cost to the best of his capacity\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_14\",\"text\":\"Safety & Compliance\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 4 (Facility Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure 100% availability and accessibility of facility safety equipment (fire extinguishers, emergency exits, alarms)\",\"Record zero major safety violations or incidents caused by facility negligence\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"comments\":\"Frequent engagement with the drivers had paved way for safety.\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_15\",\"text\":\"Reporting & Documentation\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 4 (Facility Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Submit 100% of monthly facility management reports on schedule\",\"Ensure 100% documentation of facility-related expenses and vendor services\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"He\'s timely when it comes to reporting.\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"He takes decisions that profits the business.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"He his proactive in decisions making.\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"he\'s very cordial in relationship.\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"He adhere to company policy.\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"he his a team player\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"needs training on transportation management.\",\"managerScore\":4}]','2026-07-17 12:45:23.000','If we can have some ARTISANS working under the company mostly a standby ELECTRICIAN due to some unforeseen light break out to help resolve on time rather waiting on vendor that can take a whole day before attending to the issue...will be glad if the management can look into this for a better improvement and prompt response to any electrical challenges '),
('REV001EMP003','EMP003','Iheukwumere Friday Kelechi','Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','Kelechi is very effective in his work but still needs to build more capacity as the company is growing continually. ','','Kelechi has demonstrated effectiveness in carrying out his responsibilities during the review period. HR encourages him to continue building his commitment level and capacity to meet the demands of the company\'s growth. His recommendation for a structured training plan for Supervisors and Site Representatives is noted and will be considered as part of the organization\'s learning and development initiatives.',9.455,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_26\",\"text\":\"JCC Preparation & Sign-off\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Prepare JCC for intervention and other in-house repairs within 24 hours of disbursement of funds\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"We don\'t do in-house repairs in Enugu and Asaba Region\",\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_27\",\"text\":\"Document Renewal & Record Keeping\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure that driver particulars, such as licenses, etc., are renewed monthly\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_28\",\"text\":\"Driver Welfare & Grievance Resolution\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Weekly feedback report on driver competency and welfare\",\"Reduce maintenance costs by 15% within the next 12 months, optimizing maintenance schedules and procedures\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"comments\":\"Still needs improvement in coat management. \",\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_29\",\"text\":\"Regulatory Compliance & Deadlines\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain 100% regulatory compliance, ensuring that all vehicles and drivers meet relevant laws and regulations within the next 12 months\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"He plays his part in this, however, there are some failures on the part of the drivers. \",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_30\",\"text\":\"Monthly Operational Reporting\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Prepare A Monthly Report And Submit It On Or Before The 25Th Of Each Month\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"He is very effective here. \",\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_31\",\"text\":\"Quarterly Compliance Audit & Reporting\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Quarterly Compliance Audit & Reporting\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_32\",\"text\":\"Weekly Incident Reporting\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Complete Incident Report Weekly On Mondays\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Very effective here\",\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"Still needs improvement in crisis control. \\nAlso still needs more capacity in intense pressure and multitasking\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"He needs improvement in bringing out new ideas to ease process\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Very effective here. \",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Effective to his best ability\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"Still needs to put in work in capacity building\",\"managerScore\":4}]','2026-07-20 09:14:58.000','- I suggest the company develops a training plan for Supervisors and site reps. \nThis would help alot'),
('REV001EMP004','EMP004','Tunmie Johnson Ekanmbakumo','Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','I remained committed to achieving my responsibilities, improving fleet operations, supporting my team, and ensuring compliance with company standards.','Overall performance shows effort in accountability and self‑improvement, but several areas remain below expectation. Tasks are often delayed until prompted, with reliance on excuses rather than proactive ownership. Reporting and compliance deadlines are inconsistently met, and leadership tends to be reactive rather than forward‑planning.\n\nTo improve, stronger initiative, consistency, and planning discipline are required. Proactive task execution, timely reporting, and reduced dependence on follow‑ups will enhance reliability. Emotional stability and clearer leadership presence will also build trust and set a better example for colleagues.\n\nWith focused effort on these areas, performance can progress from average to exemplary, positively impacting team outcomes and organizational objectives.','The employee has shown commitment to assigned responsibilities during the review period. HR encourages greater ownership, proactive planning, and improved consistency in task execution and reporting. Strengthening leadership presence, meeting deadlines without follow-up, and maintaining a solution-oriented approach will contribute to improved performance and greater impact in the next review period.',5.424499999999998,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_26\",\"text\":\"JCC Preparation & Sign-off\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Prepare JCC for intervention and other in-house repairs within 24 hours of disbursement of funds\"],\"selfScore\":40,\"comments\":\"\\nPrepared and processed JCCs within 24 hours of fund disbursement, ensuring timely repairs and operational efficiency.\",\"managerScore\":30,\"managerFeedback\":\"Performance on JCC preparation and sign-off has been below expectation. Tasks are often delayed until external prompts are given, requiring repeated follow-ups before completion. Greater initiative and timeliness in preparing JCCs within the 24-hour window would significantly improve efficiency and reduce the need for constant reminders.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_27\",\"text\":\"Document Renewal & Record Keeping\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure that driver particulars, such as licenses, etc., are renewed monthly\"],\"selfScore\":50,\"comments\":\"\\n\\nI ensured timely renewal of driver licenses and maintained accurate, up-to-date driver records for compliance.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"Performance meets expectation in ensuring driver particulars are renewed monthly. However, additional support is needed to address the backlog of pending bus documents and expired papers. Strengthening follow-through on outstanding renewals will help maintain compliance and ensure records remain fully up to date.\\n\",\"managerScore\":50},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_28\",\"text\":\"Driver Welfare & Grievance Resolution\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Weekly feedback report on driver competency and welfare\",\"Reduce maintenance costs by 15% within the next 12 months, optimizing maintenance schedules and procedures\"],\"selfScore\":50,\"comments\":\"Monitored driver competency and provided regular feedback.\\nImplemented preventive maintenance to minimize breakdowns.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"Performance has generally been reactive, with actions taken only after issues arise. This approach often leads to delays and heightened stress. Additionally, emotional responses during challenges can affect decision-making. To strengthen effectiveness, a more proactive stance is needed — anticipating potential issues, planning ahead, and implementing structured strategies. This will not only improve driver welfare and grievance resolution but also support the goal of reducing maintenance costs through better scheduling and foresight.\",\"managerScore\":50},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_29\",\"text\":\"Regulatory Compliance & Deadlines\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain 100% regulatory compliance, ensuring that all vehicles and drivers meet relevant laws and regulations within the next 12 months\"],\"selfScore\":60,\"comments\":\"Ensured fleet operations complied with all applicable regulations.\",\"managerScore\":50,\"managerFeedback\":\"Support is required to consistently meet the expected standard of regulatory compliance and deadlines. While efforts are being made, there is room for improvement in ensuring that all vehicles and drivers fully adhere to relevant laws and regulations within the stipulated timeframe. \"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_30\",\"text\":\"Monthly Operational Reporting\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Prepare A Monthly Report And Submit It On Or Before The 25Th Of Each Month\"],\"selfScore\":50,\"comments\":\"Consistently submitted monthly reports by the 25th with accurate operational data.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"below Expectations, havent receive any as far as monthly report is concern despite constant follow up and guideline\",\"managerScore\":40},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_31\",\"text\":\"Quarterly Compliance Audit & Reporting\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Quarterly Compliance Audit & Reporting\"],\"selfScore\":60,\"comments\":\"\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n Completed quarterly compliance audits and ensured timely reporting.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"Below expectation, always waiting for last minute to get things don  \\nPerformance is below expectation, as reports are often prepared at the last minute rather than in a timely manner. This reactive approach creates unnecessary pressure and risks missing the submission deadline. Developing a more consistent schedule and preparing reports well ahead of the 25th will improve reliability and demonstrate stronger planning discipline.\\n\",\"managerScore\":40},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_32\",\"text\":\"Weekly Incident Reporting\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Complete Incident Report Weekly On Mondays\"],\"selfScore\":20,\"comments\":\"No\",\"managerFeedback\":\"on Report, we will create a system now for weekly reporting of operation to strengthen feedback in the system\",\"managerScore\":40},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I consistently take ownership of my responsibilities and ensure assigned tasks are completed on time. I lead by example by promoting discipline, safety, and teamwork among drivers and operational staff.\",\"managerScore\":3,\"managerFeedback\":\"Overall performance is somewhat satisfying. He demonstrates effort to take responsibility and maintain accountability for deliverables, and strives to stay on top of tasks. However, there are frequent instances of providing excuses when tasks are not completed or when responsibility is avoided. Greater consistency in ownership and a stronger commitment to follow-through would enhance his leadership effectiveness and build greater trust within the team.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I take initiative to solve problems, stay committed during challenges, and always look for better ways to improve operations.\",\"managerScore\":3,\"managerFeedback\":\"Performance is average. He often waits until the last minute to complete tasks, which reduces efficiency and reliability. In addition, there is a tendency to provide excuses to avoid responsibilities rather than proactively addressing issues. Developing stronger initiative, taking ownership earlier, and persisting through challenges without deflection will significantly improve outcomes and demonstrate perseverance.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I communicate clearly, work well with my team, and maintain good relationships with colleagues and stakeholders.\",\"managerScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"Meet Expectation\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I am reliable, punctual, committed to my duties, and consistently follow company policies and procedures.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"Meet Expectation, Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\\nAdhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I assign clear targets, monitor team performance regularly, and provide feedback to help team members improve and achieve their goals.\",\"managerScore\":3,\"managerFeedback\":\"Meet Expectation\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I continuously improve my skills, seek feedback, and participate in learning opportunities to support my role and company goals.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"He is actively rooting for self‑improvement and shows willingness to grow. By setting personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives and seeking feedback, he demonstrates commitment to learning. Continued focus on completing training courses and addressing areas of weakness will further strengthen his professional capacity and ensure sustained progress.\",\"managerScore\":4}]','2026-07-20 09:16:55.000','While there are commendable efforts in certain areas, overall performance requires improvement to meet organizational standards. Key challenges observed include delays in task execution, reliance on external prompts before acting, and a tendency to provide excuses rather than taking full ownership. Strengthening proactivity, consistency, and accountability will be critical to achieving set objectives. By planning ahead, adhering strictly to deadlines, and demonstrating greater initiative, he can significantly enhance effectiveness and leadership impact. With focused effort on these areas, I believe he has the potential to move from average performance to a more reliable and exemplary level.'),
('REV001EMP005','EMP005','Aremu Abiodun Najeem','Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','','','The employee has performed satisfactorily during the review period. HR supports the recommendation for additional training in fleet management to enhance technical competence and improve overall performance. Continued learning and application of new skills will contribute to greater effectiveness in the role.',8.514999999999999,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_26\",\"text\":\"JCC Preparation & Sign-off\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Prepare JCC for intervention and other in-house repairs within 24 hours of disbursement of funds\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"comments\":\"Gets invoices from the workshop.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"He assists in omitted or missing names for completion\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_27\",\"text\":\"Document Renewal & Record Keeping\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure that driver particulars, such as licenses, etc., are renewed monthly\"],\"comments\":\"He keeps records of monthly document renewal\",\"selfScore\":90,\"managerScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"He arranges monthly documents for renewals\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_28\",\"text\":\"Driver Welfare & Grievance Resolution\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Weekly feedback report on driver competency and welfare\",\"Reduce maintenance costs by 15% within the next 12 months, optimizing maintenance schedules and procedures\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"comments\":\"He calls to check on drivers.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"He provides them with informations\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_29\",\"text\":\"Regulatory Compliance & Deadlines\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain 100% regulatory compliance, ensuring that all vehicles and drivers meet relevant laws and regulations within the next 12 months\"],\"comments\":\"he\'s always on time.\",\"selfScore\":90,\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_30\",\"text\":\"Monthly Operational Reporting\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Prepare A Monthly Report And Submit It On Or Before The 25Th Of Each Month\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"report efficient.\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_31\",\"text\":\"Quarterly Compliance Audit & Reporting\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Quarterly Compliance Audit & Reporting\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"comments\":\"He submit reports accordingly\",\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_32\",\"text\":\"Weekly Incident Reporting\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Complete Incident Report Weekly On Mondays\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"comments\":\"He completes weekly reports.\",\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"He guides the drivers in carrying out activities\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"He gives listening hear.\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"Adhere to company policies.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Team player\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"Tvet training , almost completed.\",\"managerScore\":4}]','2026-07-17 12:48:27.000','He needs more training in fleet management'),
('REV001EMP006','EMP006','Babalola Imoleayo Adelakun','Fleet 6 (Fleet Operations Manager)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','Successfully ensured the timely provision of qualified drivers, contributing to efficient transport operations and consistent service delivery.\\nStrengthen my expertise to enhance operational excellence and leadership capability.','','The employee has made a positive contribution by supporting timely driver recruitment and transport operations. HR encourages continued development of operational and leadership skills while maintaining a focus on driver management, compliance, and consistent service delivery. Continued growth in these areas will enhance overall performance and support the organization\'s objectives.',7.535749999999999,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_17\",\"text\":\"Fleet Utilization Rate\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 6 (Fleet Operations Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain a utilization rate of at least 90% of the available fleet\",\"Reduce vehicle downtime to less than 5% of operational hours\",\"Safety, Maintenance, and Compliance\"],\"selfScore\":50,\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_18\",\"text\":\"Fleet Accident Reduction\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 6 (Fleet Operations Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Reduce accident rate by 20% within the next 12 months\",\"Achieve 100% compliance with all regulatory transport requirements within the next 6 months by conducting regular audits\",\"Ensure 100% adherence to scheduled maintenance for all vehicles\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"I will work with our client in making this possible.\",\"managerScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"There has been a significant reduction incidents recently\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_19\",\"text\":\"Operational Efficiency\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 6 (Fleet Operations Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Operational Efficiency\",\"Increase the on-time delivery rate by 15% within the year by optimizing routes and providing driver training\",\"Employee Management and Development\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Reaching out to our delivery officer on meeting up with TAT and making heart and mind training hosted by our client compulsory for our drivers. \",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_20\",\"text\":\"Operations Team Professional Development\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 6 (Fleet Operations Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure ≥ 80% of the operation team members complete at least one professional development program related to transport by December 2025\",\"Retain at least 85% of drivers annually\",\"Budget Management\"],\"selfScore\":60,\"managerScore\":70},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_21\",\"text\":\"Marketing Budget Compliance\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 6 (Fleet Operations Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Percentage compliance with the allocated marketing budget with a variance of no more than 5%\",\"Business Growth\",\"Achieve a 15% year-over-year growth in revenue from logistics operations\"],\"selfScore\":50,\"managerScore\":50},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_22\",\"text\":\"Client Retention & Service Delivery\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 6 (Fleet Operations Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Retain 90% of existing clients annually through excellent service delivery\",\"Corporate Bus Deployment\",\"Achieve 100% deployment of staff buses for corporate use before the end of Q4 of the current year\"],\"comments\":\"Placing a promotional ad for the purpose of recruiting of drivers at 3regions under NBC operation.\",\"selfScore\":50,\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_23\",\"text\":\"Shuttle Fleet Deployment & Scale\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 6 (Fleet Operations Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Deploy and maintain a fleet of at least 50 buses for shuttle services between your assigned region before the end of Q4 of the current year\"],\"selfScore\":50,\"managerFeedback\":\"This is not his field\",\"managerScore\":50},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Still need more improvement in interpersonal relationship\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"comments\":\"Making a close relationship with NBC teamleads in closing out issues on time. \",\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":3,\"managerFeedback\":\"Still needs to work on his convincing power. \\nAlso the push to negotiate out of difficult situations. \"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"comments\":\"Achieve 98% on-time truck delivery while maintaining full compliance with NBC transport and safety standards.\\nReduce vehicle downtime and operational incidents through proactive fleet monitoring via calls and whatsapp, preventive maintenance, and prompt issue resolution.\\nImprove operational efficiency by ensuring accurate documentation, effective communication, and optimal fleet utilization to meet agreed service level targets.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"He puts himself into this area well, just that feedback is always difficult to get. \"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"comments\":\"Continuously enhance management objectives to improve provisions of delivery officers, safety compliance, and service delivery.\\\"\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"He needs to intentionally work on his weak points so as to get better results. \"}]','2026-07-20 09:19:16.000','Enhance transport operational efficiency by improving driver management, strengthening compliance, and delivering consistent, high quality service throughout the next review cycle.'),
('REV001EMP007','EMP007','Ochiabuto Chinonso Sophia','Marketing 5 (Social Media Executive)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','Over the review period, I have demonstrated strong ownership, initiative, and commitment to delivering results in my role as a Social Media Executive. I have successfully managed multiple digital platforms, ensuring timely customer engagement, consistent brand communication, and effective content execution. I have taken responsibility for assigned tasks, proactively solved challenges, and consistently sought ways to improve processes without requiring constant supervision.\\n\\nKey Highlights:\\n\\n* Managed and responded to over 100 customer enquiries across Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, and TikTok, ensuring timely engagement and improved customer experience.\\n* Developed and published content aligned with brand guidelines, maintaining consistency across digital platforms.\\n* Supported lead generation efforts through social media interactions, contributing to quality enquiries, returning clients, and valuable customer feedback.\\n* Monitored campaign performance and provided insights through reports to improve content strategy and engagement.\\n* Expanded my professional skill set in content creation, digital advertising, video editing, project management, communications, and currently pursuing AI automation training to improve efficiency and innovation.\\n\\nCareer Development Goals:\\nMy goal is to continue growing into a more strategic communications and digital marketing professional by strengthening my skills in data-driven marketing, automation, brand strategy, and campaign management. I aim to take on greater responsibilities, contribute more to business growth, and develop leadership capabilities that allow me to mentor others and drive impactful projects.','Sophia has improved significantly since her last review and has demonstrated greater ownership of her responsibilities. Going forward, she should focus on maintaining this momentum and consistently delivering strong performance.','Employee has shown commendable improvement during the review period and has taken greater ownership of her responsibilities. HR encourages her to maintain this progress while continuing to develop her communication, digital marketing, and leadership skills. Her career development goals are well aligned with the organization\'s objectives, and continued learning and consistent performance will support her growth.',8.89,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_MARKETING_13\",\"text\":\"Social Media Reach & Analytics\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Marketing 5 (Social Media Executive)\"],\"description\":[\"Respond to 95% of social media enquiries within 24 hours\",\"Ensure all posts adhere to brand guidelines and are published as scheduled (100%)\",\"Track campaign results and deliver monthly reports with actionable insights\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"* Responded to over 500 social media enquiries across Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, and TikTok, ensuring prompt responses and no unattended messages.\\n* Achieved 100% compliance with approved brand guidelines and content schedules.\\n* Produced monthly performance reports highlighting key metrics, campaign outcomes, audience insights, and recommendations that informed future marketing decisions.\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_MARKETING_14\",\"text\":\"Social Media Reach & Analytics\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Marketing 5 (Social Media Executive)\"],\"description\":[\"Generate at least 10 qualified customer leads per month from social media interactions\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"* Generated over 500 qualified leads from 2,206 social media interactions, achieving a 22.7% lead generation rate.\\n* Consistently attracted quality enquiries, returning clients, and valuable customer feedback across Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, and TikTok, contributing to business growth.\\n* Supported the sales pipeline by engaging prospects and directing qualified enquiries to the appropriate team for conversion.\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"* Managed and maintained the company’s presence across LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, and X, ensuring consistent content delivery and engagement.\\n* Led the planning and coordination of the company’s Mid-Year Praise Party, including programme development, video coverage, and content creation.\\n* Collaborated with the SkillUp team to support the planning and execution of the Summer Campaign, contributing to its marketing activities.\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"Self Comment:\\nI demonstrate the ability to take initiative and lead effectively, even when faced with challenges. I consistently go the extra mile to deliver results, proactively identify solutions, and acquire the necessary resources and information required to execute tasks successfully without the need for constant supervision.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Self Comment:\\nI actively support team performance by providing clarity on expectations, collaborating with colleagues on deliverables, and offering guidance where needed. I regularly monitor progress, provide constructive feedback, and encourage continuous improvement to help achieve team goals and maintain accountability.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I consider myself highly professional. \",\"managerScore\":3},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I ensure all reports are accurately and adequately compiled.\\nI provide useful feedback and guidance to help the team achieve targets.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Self Comment:\\nOver the years, I have continuously developed my skills in areas aligned with organizational goals, including content creation, digital advertising, video editing, project management, and strategic communications. I actively seek opportunities to improve my capabilities and expand my knowledge, and I am currently undergoing AI automation training to enhance efficiency and innovation in my work.\",\"managerScore\":5}]','2026-07-17 12:50:32.000','* Follower Growth: Increased from 2,000 to 3,000+ followers — 50% growth\\n* Social Media Reach: Achieved 100,000+ impressions/reach across platforms\\n* Customer Engagement: Managed 500+ social media enquiries/DMs\\n* Lead Conversion: Achieved approximately 50% conversion rate from qualified enquiries to potential customers.\\n\\nGoals and Actions for Improvement (Next Review Cycle):\\n\\n* Strengthen digital strategy execution: Gain deeper insights into content performance, audience behavior, and industry trends to identify what drives engagement, leads, and conversions.\\n* Enhance professional expertise: Continue developing skills in digital marketing, analytics, AI tools, automation, and content strategy to improve efficiency and deliver stronger results.\\n* Drive business growth through social media: Develop more conversion-focused campaigns, improve lead generation processes, and strengthen engagement strategies to support sales objectives.\\n* Optimize LinkedIn and YouTube growth: Implement targeted strategies to increase brand visibility, audience growth, thought leadership, and business opportunities across both platforms.\\n\\n'),
('REV001EMP008','EMP008','Opeyemi Ismaila','Admin/HR 2 (Front Desk)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_3\",\"text\":\"Visitor Management & Professional Appearance\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Admin/HR 2 (Front Desk)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure 100% registration and direction of visitors to their destination within 5 minutes of arrival\",\"Professional Appearance\",\"Ensure 100% professional demeanor and appearance at all times\"]},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_4\",\"text\":\"Front Desk Office Supplies & Task Execution\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Admin/HR 2 (Front Desk)\"],\"description\":[\"Administrative Task\",\"Ensure constant supply/restock of toiletries and stationery each week\",\"Timely execution of all given tasks\"]},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"]},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"]},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"]},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"]},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"]},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"]}]','2026-07-15 14:28:55.000',NULL),
('REV001EMP009','EMP009','Odubiyi Oluwaseun','Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','','','The employee has performed satisfactorily during the review period. HR supports the recommendation for training in fleet management, vehicle maintenance, and cost reduction to strengthen technical knowledge and improve overall performance in the role. ',9.139999999999999,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_26\",\"text\":\"JCC Preparation & Sign-off\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Prepare JCC for intervention and other in-house repairs within 24 hours of disbursement of funds\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"He prepares Jcc for timely submission.\",\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_27\",\"text\":\"Document Renewal & Record Keeping\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure that driver particulars, such as licenses, etc., are renewed monthly\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"He keeps all records for present and future use.\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_28\",\"text\":\"Driver Welfare & Grievance Resolution\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Weekly feedback report on driver competency and welfare\",\"Reduce maintenance costs by 15% within the next 12 months, optimizing maintenance schedules and procedures\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Very active in driver\'s welfare.\",\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_29\",\"text\":\"Regulatory Compliance & Deadlines\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain 100% regulatory compliance, ensuring that all vehicles and drivers meet relevant laws and regulations within the next 12 months\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"He ensures all drivers are keep within the space of law enforcement agent and procedures.\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_30\",\"text\":\"Monthly Operational Reporting\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Prepare A Monthly Report And Submit It On Or Before The 25Th Of Each Month\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"He keeps monthly records.\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_31\",\"text\":\"Quarterly Compliance Audit & Reporting\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Quarterly Compliance Audit & Reporting\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"He\'s 90% okay on this .\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_32\",\"text\":\"Weekly Incident Reporting\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Complete Incident Report Weekly On Mondays\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"He hits weekly targets.\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"He leads by example\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"He\'s team player.\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"He builds himself with work relationship and this has really kept the business\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"He\'s very committed in regular checking up of his team\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4}]','2026-07-17 12:56:41.000','needs fleet management training, maintenance and cost reduction.'),
('REV001EMP010','EMP010','Isaac Ekpo James','Marketing 3 (Marketing Executive)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','None','Compared to the last review, Isaac has shown noticeable improvement in most areas of his role. He has demonstrated growth in performance and commitment. However, he needs to be more intentional about setting personal reminders for assigned tasks, responding promptly to requests, and consistently following up with team members to ensure tasks are completed effectively. Stronger ownership and proactive communication will further enhance his performance.','Isaac has shown good improvement during the review period and demonstrated greater commitment to his responsibilities. HR encourages him to build on this progress by improving task follow-up, responsiveness, and proactive communication. His development goals align with his role, and consistent execution will further strengthen his performance and contribution to the team.',8.69,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_MARKETING_9\",\"text\":\"Digital Engagement & Campaign Performance\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Marketing 3 (Marketing Executive)\"],\"description\":[\"Growth in marketing-generated leads and customer enquiries\",\"Engagement performance across digital platforms\",\"Contribution of marketing activities to sales and brand visibility\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"- Was able generate 7000 leads \\n- Got 100 enquiry \\nViews: 788.2k\\nInteractions: 3k\\nfollowers: 79\\nFacebook views increased by 100% in 6months\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_MARKETING_10\",\"text\":\"Brand Visibility & Campaign Quality\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Marketing 3 (Marketing Executive)\"],\"description\":[\"Timely delivery and quality of marketing materials and campaigns\"],\"comments\":\"Video performance: 12.9k\\nSocial media reach: 577.2k\\nContent interaction: 2.6k\\n3-second views: 6.3k\",\"selfScore\":90,\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"90% of issues resolved within agreed timelines\\n100% ownership of assigned tasks\\n80%  assigned tasks completed without repeated follow-up\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"comments\":\"Completed 100% of assigned learning activities and apply knowledge to work.\\nAbility to adjust to changing priorities and business needs.\\nCompleted 80% of assigned learning activities and apply knowledge to work\",\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":3},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"Was able to work effectively with colleagues across departments.\\nMaintains positive and professional relationships with internal and external stakeholders.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"98% of scheduled workdays attended\\n96% of days arriving on time for work and meetings\\n90% of assigned tasks completed as agreed\\nDemonstrates integrity, respect, and ethical behavior at work\",\"managerScore\":3},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"At least 80% achieve their targets\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"none\",\"managerScore\":5}]','2026-07-17 12:58:40.000','- Increase lead generation, optimize campaigns, and improve engagement using data-driven strategies.\\n- Execute consistent marketing campaigns and maintain brand standards across all platforms.\\n'),
('REV001EMP011','EMP011','Ekwealor Oluchi Ugochi','NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','During this review period, I consistently demonstrated commitment, accountability, and professionalism in carrying out my responsibilities as a Fleet Monitoring Officer. I contributed to improved fleet utilization, driver compliance, timely incident detection, and accurate reporting through proactive monitoring, effective communication, and prompt issue escalation. I adapted well to operational demands, collaborated effectively with colleagues, and remained focused on achieving team and organizational objectives. Going forward, I am committed to further improving my technical skills, enhancing operational efficiency, and continuing to deliver high-quality results that support the company’s goals.','During the review period, the employee consistently demonstrated commitment, accountability, and professionalism in carrying out her responsibilities as a Fleet Monitoring Officer. She made significant contributions to fleet efficiency through effective real-time monitoring, timely incident detection and escalation, accurate reporting, and strong communication with drivers and stakeholders. Her dedication to operational excellence improved fleet visibility, supported driver compliance, and minimized operational disruptions.\n\nShe also exhibited strong teamwork, reliability, and a willingness to learn and adapt to changing operational demands. Going forward, further development in analytical, problem-solving, and technical skills will enhance her effectiveness and enable her to contribute even more strategically to the achievement of organizational objectives. Overall, she is a dependable team member who consistently delivers value and positively impacts fleet operations.','',8.8625,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_7\",\"text\":\"Vehicle Utilization & Efficiency\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Fleet Utilization Rate: Increased by 30% Percent due to proper monitoring and frequent call outs\",\"30% Reduction in Idle Time: Decrease in unnecessary vehicle idling time\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"During the review period, I consistently monitored vehicle movements in real time and promptly followed up with drivers whenever delays, prolonged idling, or route deviations were observed. Through regular call-outs, timely escalations, and close coordination with drivers and supervisors, I contributed to improved fleet utilization and a significant reduction in unnecessary idle time. These efforts helped ensure vehicles were deployed more efficiently, adhered to operational schedules, and supported overall fleet productivity.\",\"managerScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrated strong initiative in fleet monitoring and proactive follow-up on operational issues. Her timely escalations and effective coordination contributed to improved fleet utilization and reduced idle time, positively impacting overall operational efficiency.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_8\",\"text\":\"Driver Performance & Safety\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Driver Compliance Rate: Increase the number of averted risks due to call-outs\",\"Number of Violations: Reduce cases of speeding, harsh braking, and long parking\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"I actively monitored driver behavior and promptly contacted drivers whenever unsafe practices such as speeding, harsh braking, prolonged parking, or route deviations were detected. Through timely call-outs and escalations, I helped avert potential risks, improved driver compliance with operational and safety standards.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrated strong commitment to driver safety and compliance through proactive monitoring and timely interventions. Her prompt follow-ups and escalations contributed to improved driver behavior, reduced operational risks, and enhanced adherence to safety standards.\",\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_9\",\"text\":\"Reporting & Monitoring Accuracy\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Report Timeliness: Percentage of reports submitted on time (daily, weekly, monthly)\",\"Data Accuracy Rate: Accuracy and reliability of fleet reports generated\",\"Incident Reporting Response Time: Average time taken to detect and escalate issues\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"I consistently ensured that daily operational reports were submitted within the required timelines while maintaining a high level of accuracy and reliability in the data provided. Through continuous real-time fleet monitoring, I promptly detected and escalated incidents, enabling timely intervention and minimizing operational disruptions. My attention to detail and commitment to accurate reporting supported effective decision-making and improved overall fleet visibility.\\nEvidence: * Preparing daily fleet activity reports.\\n* Sending NBC escalation reports before the required deadline.\\n* Monitoring vehicles in real time using the INSIGHT tracking system.\\n* Promptly escalating issues to supervisors.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrated strong attention to detail and accountability by consistently delivering timely and accurate reports. Her proactive monitoring and prompt escalation of incidents supported effective decision-making and minimized operational disruptions.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_10\",\"text\":\"Alarm Detection & Monitoring\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Alarm Detection & Monitoring\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"I consistently monitored the fleet tracking system to identify and respond to alarms such as speeding, route deviations, prolonged idling and geofence breaches. Upon detecting alarms, I promptly  contacted drivers where necessary, and escalated critical issues to the appropriate regional supervisors ( Benin, Owerri and Port harcourt) for swift resolution. My proactive monitoring helped minimize operational risks, improve compliance, and ensure continuous visibility of fleet activities.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrated strong vigilance and accountability in fleet monitoring by promptly addressing alarms and escalating critical issues. Her diligent approach improved compliance, reduced operational risks, and ensured continuous visibility of fleet activities.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I consistently took ownership of my assigned responsibilities and ensured that tasks were completed accurately and within the required timelines. I maintained accountability for my deliverables, communicated proactively when issues arose, and collaborated effectively with colleagues to support smooth fleet operations. I also shared knowledge and provided guidance to team members when needed, while leading by example through professionalism, reliability, and adherence to company procedures.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrated a high level of ownership and accountability by consistently delivering assigned tasks accurately and on time. She collaborates effectively with colleagues, supports team members when needed, and leads by example through professionalism, reliability, and adherence to company procedures.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I consistently demonstrated initiative by proactively identifying and addressing operational issues during fleet monitoring without waiting for instructions. Whenever abnormalities or delays were detected, I promptly followed up with drivers and escalated critical concerns to ensure timely \",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrated strong initiative and ownership by promptly identifying and addressing operational issues. Her timely follow-ups and escalations contributed to quick resolution of concerns and supported smooth fleet operations.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I maintained clear, professional, and timely communication with drivers, supervisors, and other stakeholders to ensure smooth fleet operations. I actively listened to concerns, provided prompt updates on incidents and operational issues, and worked collaboratively with team members to resolve challenges efficiently. By fostering positive working relationships and open communication, I contributed to improved coordination, quicker response times, and overall operational effectiveness.\",\"managerScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrated effective communication and collaboration by maintaining timely and professional interactions with drivers, supervisors, and stakeholders. Her ability to provide prompt updates and work collaboratively contributed to improved coordination, faster issue resolution, and overall operational efficiency.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I consistently demonstrated a strong work ethic by carrying out my responsibilities with dedication, reliability, and professionalism. I maintained punctuality and regular attendance, ensuring my duties were performed without disruption and deadlines were consistently met. I adhered to the company’s policies, operational procedures, and code of conduct while maintaining integrity, confidentiality, and a positive attitude in all work-related activities.\",\"managerScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrated a strong work ethic through reliability, professionalism, and consistent adherence to company policies and procedures. She maintained punctuality, met deadlines, and carried out her responsibilities with integrity and dedication.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I actively support team objectives by collaborating effectively with colleagues, sharing relevant information, and providing assistance when needed to ensure operational targets are achieved. I also remain open to feedback and contribute positively to the overall performance of the team.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrated strong teamwork by supporting colleagues, sharing information, and contributing positively to team goals. She remains open to feedback and collaborates effectively to achieve operational objectives.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I remained committed to my personal and professional development by continuously improving my knowledge of fleet monitoring operations and adapting to new systems and processes. I actively sought feedback from supervisors and colleagues to enhance my performance and identify areas for improvement. I also took advantage of learning opportunities to strengthen my technical and operational skills, enabling me to contribute more effectively to the achievement of organizational goals.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrated a strong commitment to continuous learning and self-development by actively seeking feedback and improving operational knowledge and skills. Her willingness to learn and adapt has enhanced her effectiveness and contribution to organizational goals.\"}]','2026-07-20 09:09:01.000','Over the next review period, I plan to further improve my efficiency in fleet monitoring by strengthening my analytical and problem-solving skills, enhancing the accuracy and timeliness of operational reporting, and deepening my knowledge of the fleet management systems used by the organization. I also aim to improve my communication and incident management skills through continuous feedback, learning opportunities, and relevant training. My goal is to contribute more effectively to operational excellence, safety, and the achievement of the company’s performance objectives.'),
('REV001EMP012','EMP012','Onebunne Ginika Perpetus','Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','During the 2026 mid-year review period, I consistently demonstrated commitment, accountability, and professionalism in carrying out my responsibilities as a Fleet Supervisor. I successfully managed key fleet operations by ensuring timely vehicle maintenance coordination, monitoring driver documentation and compliance, submitting operational and incident reports within required timelines, and supporting the overall efficiency and safety of fleet activities. I also maintained effective communication with drivers, colleagues, and management while proactively resolving operational challenges and promoting teamwork.\\nSome of my key highlights include maintaining accurate fleet records, improving compliance with document renewals, supporting preventive maintenance initiatives to reduce vehicle downtime and maintenance costs, and providing regular feedback on driver performance and welfare. I remained focused on delivering quality results, meeting organizational expectations, and contributing to the achievement of departmental objectives.\\nGoing forward, my career development goals are to strengthen my leadership and fleet management capabilities, enhance my knowledge of fleet optimization, preventive maintenance, and compliance management, and pursue relevant professional training and certifications. I also aim to improve data analysis and reporting skills, develop more efficient operational processes, and take on greater leadership responsibilities that will contribute to the continued success and growth of the organization.','The Fleet Supervisor has demonstrated strong commitment and professionalism across key performance areas, including JCC preparation, document renewal, driver welfare, regulatory compliance, leadership, initiative, KPI deployment, and self‑improvement. Their proactive approach, attention to detail, and willingness to learn have contributed positively to fleet operations, driver engagement, and compliance standards.\n\nWhile performance is commendable, some gaps remain in areas such as timely JCC sign‑off, expired vehicle documents, missing LASDRI certifications, and the need for deeper technical knowledge in fleet management and vehicle maintenance. With structured support from the maintenance and accounts teams, and continued focus on empowering colleagues, they are well‑positioned to achieve and sustain 100% compliance and operational efficiency.\n\nOverall, the Fleet Supervisor is a motivated and resilient team member who consistently strives to be the best, seeks continuous improvement, and shows strong potential for growth. With targeted development and collaborative support, they will further strengthen leadership impact and deliver even greater value to the organization.','The employee has demonstrated commitment and a strong desire to grow in the role. The development goals outlined are well aligned with the manager\'s feedback and the organization\'s objectives. HR encourages the employee to continue building leadership capability, strengthen operational efficiency and compliance, and pursue relevant training to maximize performance and contribute greater value to the organization.',9.09525,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_26\",\"text\":\"JCC Preparation & Sign-off\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Prepare JCC for intervention and other in-house repairs within 24 hours of disbursement of funds\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"I maintained close coordination with the maintenance team and relevant stakeholders to ensure timely documentation, minimize delays in repair activities, and support efficient fleet operations. My commitment to accuracy and prompt processing contributed to improved accountability, operational efficiency, and vehicle availability.\",\"managerScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"The Fleet Supervisor has maintained strong coordination and accuracy in JCC preparation, supporting accountability and timely repairs. While performance is commendable, occasional Approval delays prevented full consistency with the 24‑hour target; a structured tracking /approval system will help sustain 100% compliance going forward.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_27\",\"text\":\"Document Renewal & Record Keeping\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure that driver particulars, such as licenses, etc., are renewed monthly\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"During the review period, I consistently monitored the validity of driver documents, including driver\'s licenses and other required particulars, to ensure timely renewals before expiration. I maintained accurate and up-to-date records, followed up with drivers on pending renewals, and ensured compliance with company and regulatory requirements. This proactive approach helped minimize operational disruptions, supported fleet compliance, and ensured that all drivers remained properly documented and eligible for duty.\",\"managerScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"The Fleet Supervisor has shown diligence in monitoring driver documents and maintaining accurate records, which supported compliance and minimized disruptions. However, some drivers still lack valid LASDRI certification and certain vehicle documents have expired, which must be addressed promptly to achieve full compliance. Going forward, a stricter tracking and escalation system should be implemented to ensure 100% validity across all driver and vehicle documentation.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_28\",\"text\":\"Driver Welfare & Grievance Resolution\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Weekly feedback report on driver competency and welfare\",\"Reduce maintenance costs by 15% within the next 12 months, optimizing maintenance schedules and procedures\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"I provided regular weekly feedback on driver competency, performance, and welfare, while maintaining open communication with drivers to identify and address concerns promptly. I followed up on grievances, escalated issues where necessary, and worked collaboratively with relevant teams to ensure timely resolutions. This contributed to improved driver engagement, compliance, and overall operational efficiency.\",\"managerScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"The Fleet Supervisor provided weekly feedback on driver competency and welfare, maintained open communication, and resolved grievances promptly, which improved engagement and compliance. However, further focus is needed on optimizing maintenance schedules to achieve the targeted 15% cost reduction within the next 12 months.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_29\",\"text\":\"Regulatory Compliance & Deadlines\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain 100% regulatory compliance, ensuring that all vehicles and drivers meet relevant laws and regulations within the next 12 months\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Throughout the next 12 months, I will maintain 100% regulatory compliance by ensuring that all vehicles and drivers meet applicable legal, licensing, safety, and operational requirements. I will monitor expiry dates for licences, permits, inspections, insurance, and other mandatory documentation, and take proactive action to prevent any lapses.\\n\\nI will also work closely with drivers, maintenance, and operations teams to address compliance gaps promptly, complete required checks and reporting on time, and escalate any risks immediately. These actions will help ensure full adherence to relevant laws and regulations, reduce compliance exposure, and support safe and efficient fleet operations.\",\"managerScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"The Fleet Supervisor has shown commitment to monitoring documentation and ensuring compliance, but because he was newly onboarded, some gaps remain with expired vehicle documents and Drivers\' LASDRI certifications. We will provide support and guidance to help establish a robust tracking and escalation system, ensuring all driver and vehicle records are valid and maintained consistently. With this support, they are expected to achieve and sustain 100% regulatory compliance within the next 12 months\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_30\",\"text\":\"Monthly Operational Reporting\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Prepare A Monthly Report And Submit It On Or Before The 25Th Of Each Month\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"I consistently prepared and submitted comprehensive monthly operational reports on or before the 25th of each month. The reports accurately captured fleet activities, vehicle maintenance status, driver performance, operational challenges, and key observations. By ensuring timely and accurate reporting, I supported informed decision-making, improved operational visibility, and maintained compliance with the organization\'s reporting requirements.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"This is his first month on the Job and in the role, he is meeting up to expectation, and we hope for more positive supports and results to bring out the best in him.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_31\",\"text\":\"Quarterly Compliance Audit & Reporting\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Quarterly Compliance Audit & Reporting\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Throughout the review period, I actively supported quarterly compliance audits by ensuring that fleet records, vehicle documentation, driver credentials, maintenance records, and other operational documents were complete, accurate, and readily available for review. I promptly identified and addressed compliance gaps, implemented corrective actions where necessary, and submitted audit reports within the required timelines. These efforts contributed to maintaining regulatory compliance, improving operational accountability, and supporting continuous improvement across fleet operations.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"This is his first month on the Job and in the role, he is meeting up to expectation, and we hope for more positive supports and results to bring out the best in him  \",\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_32\",\"text\":\"Weekly Incident Reporting\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 8 (Fleet Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Complete Incident Report Weekly On Mondays\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"I consistently prepared and submitted weekly incident reports every Monday as required. The reports accurately documented vehicle incidents, safety observations, operational issues, and corrective actions taken. I ensured that all reports were timely, detailed, and fact-based, providing management with the information needed to monitor trends, address risks promptly, and improve fleet safety and operational performance.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"Meets Expectation \",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I consistently demonstrated responsibility and ownership of my assigned duties by ensuring tasks were completed accurately, on time, and in line with company standards. I led by example through professionalism, integrity, and a strong work ethic, while providing guidance and support to drivers and colleagues whenever needed. I remained accountable for my deliverables, proactively addressed operational challenges, and followed through on assigned responsibilities to ensure the smooth and efficient operation of the fleet.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"The Fleet Supervisor consistently demonstrated responsibility and ownership of assigned duties, completing tasks accurately and on time while maintaining company standards.\\n\\nHe led by example through professionalism and integrity, guided colleagues effectively, and remained accountable for deliverables by proactively addressing operational challenges. \",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I consistently demonstrated initiative by identifying operational challenges early and taking proactive steps to resolve them without waiting for instructions. I remained persistent when faced with obstacles, working collaboratively with relevant teams to ensure issues were addressed effectively and operations continued with minimal disruption. I also sought opportunities to improve workflows by promoting preventive maintenance, strengthening follow-up processes, and enhancing documentation and reporting practices, contributing to greater efficiency and continuous improvement in fleet operations.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"The Fleet Supervisor consistently demonstrates initiative, always striving to be the best, eager to learn, and proactive in resolving issues without waiting for instructions. He shows perseverance in overcoming obstacles and improving workflows but will require stronger support from the maintenance and accounts teams to make timely decisions and sustain efficiency. With this collaboration, their drive and resilience can be fully harnessed to achieve even greater operational impact.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Throughout the review period, I maintained clear, professional, and effective communication with drivers, colleagues, supervisors, and other stakeholders to ensure smooth fleet operations. I actively listened to concerns, provided timely feedback, and worked collaboratively with team members to resolve operational issues efficiently. By fostering mutual respect, cooperation, and positive working relationships, I contributed to improved teamwork, effective coordination, and the successful achievement of departmental objectives.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"Meets Expectation \\n\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Throughout the review period, I consistently demonstrated a high level of reliability, professionalism, and commitment in carrying out my responsibilities as a Fleet Supervisor. I maintained excellent punctuality and attendance, ensuring that assigned tasks were completed within stipulated timelines while supporting uninterrupted fleet operations. I also adhered strictly to the company\'s policies, procedures, and code of conduct, promoting integrity, discipline, accountability, and a positive work culture in all aspects of my duties\",\"managerFeedback\":\" \\nExceeds Expectation \",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Throughout the review period, I effectively communicated performance expectations to my team by assigning clear responsibilities and monitoring progress against established KPIs. I regularly assessed the performance of drivers and other direct reports, provided constructive feedback, and offered guidance and coaching to address performance gaps and improve productivity. Through continuous engagement and performance monitoring, I supported my team in meeting operational targets, maintaining compliance, and contributing to the overall success of fleet operations\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Meet Expectation\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Throughout the review period, I remained committed to my personal and professional development by setting improvement goals aligned with the organization\'s objectives. I actively sought feedback from my supervisors and colleagues to enhance my performance and identify areas for growth. I also took advantage of available learning opportunities, including training sessions and self-development initiatives, to strengthen my leadership, fleet management, and operational skills. These efforts have enabled me to perform my responsibilities more effectively and contribute positively to the achievement of departmental and organizational goals.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"Meet Expectation.\\nThe Fleet Supervisor has shown strong commitment to personal development by setting goals, seeking feedback, and engaging in training opportunities. To further strengthen their effectiveness, they should pursue deeper knowledge in fleet management, transportation systems, and basic vehicle maintenance, enabling them to better follow up when drivers report issues. With this added technical foundation, their leadership and decision‑making will be more impactful and aligned with organizational objectives.\",\"managerScore\":4}]','2026-07-20 09:21:26.000','Over the next review cycle, I will focus on improving fleet operational efficiency, strengthening compliance, and enhancing team performance. My priority will be to ensure 100% compliance with vehicle and driver documentation, improve preventive maintenance planning to further reduce vehicle downtime and maintenance costs, and maintain timely submission of all operational, incident, and compliance reports.\\nI will also strengthen driver performance management by conducting regular coaching sessions, providing timely feedback, and promoting a strong safety culture to reduce incidents and improve operational discipline. In addition, I plan to enhance my leadership, communication, and analytical skills through continuous learning, professional training, and relevant fleet management certifications. I will leverage data-driven reporting to identify operational trends, implement process improvements, and support informed decision-making, while continuing to contribute to the organization\'s overall goals through accountability, teamwork, and continuous improvement.'),
('REV001EMP013','EMP013','Ibemere Onyekachi Precious','NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','Throughout the review period, I consistently demonstrated commitment, initiative, and accountability in my role. I supported team development by sharing my knowledge, mentoring colleagues, and helping others understand key processes, while maintaining high performance and contributing to the achievement of departmental objectives.','Throughout the review period, the employee consistently demonstrated commitment, initiative, accountability, and professionalism in carrying out his responsibilities. He maintained high performance standards, contributed to operational efficiency through effective monitoring and reporting, and proactively resolved issues to support smooth operations. He also displayed strong leadership by mentoring colleagues, sharing knowledge, communicating expectations clearly, and supporting team development.\n\nHis reliability, punctuality, and adherence to company policies contributed positively to team performance and the achievement of departmental objectives. He consistently fostered collaboration, provided guidance to colleagues, and remained committed to personal and professional growth through continuous learning and feedback.\n\nGoing forward, further development in strategic thinking, analytical capabilities, and leadership skills will enhance his effectiveness and enable him to contribute even more significantly to organizational success. Overall, he is a dependable and valuable team member who consistently delivers positive results and adds value to the organization.','The employee has demonstrated consistent commitment and made valuable contributions during the review period. HR commends the positive attitude toward teamwork, knowledge sharing, and accountability. Continued focus on developing leadership skills and maintaining this level of performance will support both personal growth and the organization\'s success.',8.459999999999999,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_7\",\"text\":\"Vehicle Utilization & Efficiency\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Fleet Utilization Rate: Increased by 30% Percent due to proper monitoring and frequent call outs\",\"30% Reduction in Idle Time: Decrease in unnecessary vehicle idling time\"],\"selfScore\":70,\"comments\":\"I frequently monitor the vehicle \",\"managerFeedback\":\"Exhibited diligence and consistency in monitoring vehicle activities, contributing to improved fleet visibility and timely identification of operational issues. His efforts support effective fleet management and operational efficiency.\",\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_8\",\"text\":\"Driver Performance & Safety\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Driver Compliance Rate: Increase the number of averted risks due to call-outs\",\"Number of Violations: Reduce cases of speeding, harsh braking, and long parking\"],\"comments\":\"I proactively monitored driver activities and made timely call-outs whenever unsafe behavior or potential risks were identified. These interventions helped improve driver compliance with safety procedures and prevented incidents before they occurred\",\"selfScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"Exhibited strong attention to driver safety by promptly addressing unsafe behaviors and potential risks. His timely interventions contributed to improved compliance with safety procedures and supported incident prevention\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_9\",\"text\":\"Reporting & Monitoring Accuracy\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Report Timeliness: Percentage of reports submitted on time (daily, weekly, monthly)\",\"Data Accuracy Rate: Accuracy and reliability of fleet reports generated\",\"Incident Reporting Response Time: Average time taken to detect and escalate issues\"],\"selfScore\":70,\"comments\":\"I make sure i professionally submitt \\nreport  day and weekly. I make sure the report I submit are accurate and up to date\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"Displayed a strong sense of responsibility by consistently submitting accurate and timely daily and weekly reports. His attention to detail and commitment to maintaining up-to-date information support effective decision-making and operational efficiency.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_10\",\"text\":\"Alarm Detection & Monitoring\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Alarm Detection & Monitoring\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"comments\":\"I created a  notification sound, so when  any vehicle ignition comes on I will be aware of it\",\"managerScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"Displayed initiative and innovation by creating a notification system to promptly detect vehicle ignition activity. This improvement enhanced monitoring efficiency and enabled quicker response to fleet movements.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"comments\":\"I demonstrate ownership of every task that is assigned to me, I lead by example, and guide my colleagues, and put them through in case they have any challenges \",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Showed strong ownership and leadership by taking responsibility for assigned tasks and providing guidance and support to colleagues when needed. His willingness to assist team members contributes positively to teamwork and operational effectiveness.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"comments\":\"I take proactive steps to resolve any issues without waiting for instructions, and I construct improvements to make the workflow effective \",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"Displayed initiative and problem-solving skills by addressing issues independently and implementing improvements to enhance workflow efficiency. His ability to take action without constant supervision contributes positively to operational effectiveness.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I communicate clearly and efficiently with my team members and make everyone feel welcome, I also listen actively and cooperate well with other.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"Displayed effective communication and teamwork by engaging clearly with colleagues, fostering an inclusive work environment, and collaborating well with others. His willingness to listen and cooperate contributes positively to team cohesion and operational success.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I show extremely high reliability and commitment to my work and tasks that are assigned to me, and I also maintain consistent punctuality in my attendance. I make sure I come on time  and adhere strictly to the code of conduct \",\"managerFeedback\":\"Displayed a strong work ethic through reliability, commitment, and consistent punctuality. He adheres to company policies and the code of conduct while carrying out assigned responsibilities with professionalism and dedication.\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"comments\":\"I clearly communicated KPIs to team members, monitored their performance consistently, and provided regular feedback and coaching to help them improve and achieve their assigned targets.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrated effective leadership by setting clear expectations, monitoring team performance, and providing guidance that supported the achievement of assigned targets.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"comments\":\"I set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives, actively sought feedback to improve my performance, and completed relevant training to enhance my skills and knowledge.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrated a strong commitment to personal and professional development by pursuing learning opportunities, seeking feedback, and aligning growth initiatives with organizational objectives.\",\"managerScore\":4}]','2026-07-20 09:30:27.000',''),
('REV001EMP014','EMP014','Nwaoha Michael Onyekwere','Fleet 7 (HSE Executive)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','Over time i can very much tell that my performance here in New Era Transport Services have greatly improved because i have successfully closed critical audits from various clients and government bodies.','','The employee has demonstrated good progress during the review period and contributed to the successful closure of key client and regulatory audits. HR encourages the employee to continue building on this performance by maintaining high standards, strengthening technical expertise, and contributing to continuous improvement across the organization.',8.26,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_24\",\"text\":\"Incident Report Submission Speed\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 7 (HSE Executive)\"],\"description\":[\"Incidence report submission not more than 12 hours after the occurrence\",\"Monthly incidence rate and near miss not more than 2\",\"100% availability of First Aid box items at all times\"],\"comments\":\"Incident reports are expected to be communicated within 12 hours as there are consequences to non compliance, i ensure weekly checks for the first aid box items to be sure they are always available.\",\"selfScore\":80,\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_25\",\"text\":\"HSE Incident Action Closure\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 7 (HSE Executive)\"],\"description\":[\"Corrective action closure plans submission within 24 hours of incidence\",\"80% all time customer satisfaction majorly from driver performance metrics\",\"Zero tolerance for security breaches or theft incidents\"],\"comments\":\"Security breaches and theft incidents are never ignored and have severe consequence as staffs and workplace safety are prioritized.\",\"selfScore\":80,\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"comments\":\"I maintain that i demonstrate responsibility of task outcome in my purview as a safety executive as its my duty to provide a safe working environment as i roll out policies that mitigates or reduce potential risk. \",\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"comments\":\"Being proactive in my duties keeps me ahead and on top of situations through my risk assessments and daily inspections around the workplace areas. Also ensure that staffs are carried along on the need to improve on safety responsibilities.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"comments\":\"I have a culture whereby i put out a weekly safety tips on every platforms to communicate safe working practices.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"comments\":\"I ensure that every task assigned to me is effectively and efficiently done and closed within timelines. \",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Needs to improve on timelines\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"comments\":\"I desire to further develop myself in skills like project management or data analysis which i know would always keep me relevant in the evolving global employment market.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":5}]','2026-07-20 10:29:56.000','As i practice further, I\'m pretty sure to gain more experience including going further to bagging more professional certifications.'),
('REV001EMP015','EMP015','Ishaq Ibrahim','Fleet 5 (Fleet Maintenance North)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Submitted','',NULL,NULL,0,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_FLEET_16\",\"text\":\"Fleet Records Accuracy\",\"weight\":40,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Fleet 5 (Fleet Maintenance North)\"],\"description\":[\"30% reduction in repairs and running costs within the region\",\"Timeliness in reporting and resolving repair issues within 24 hours\",\"All-time truck availability for the client’s use\"],\"selfScore\":70},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":3}]','2026-07-22 08:36:17.000',''),
('REV001EMP016','EMP016','Umezurike Esther Chinaza','Admin/HR 1 (Front Desk & Account Support)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Submitted','I’ve focused on keeping our front office professional, organized, and reliable. Balancing visitor management with hands-on finance support has given me a great view of our daily operations. I\'m proud of the work ethic and consistency I’ve brought to the team, and I’m excited to keep raising the bar.\"\\n​Improvement Plan',NULL,NULL,2.94,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_1\",\"text\":\"Visitor Management & Professional Appearance\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Admin/HR 1 (Front Desk & Account Support)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain 100% accurate front desk and visitor records\",\"Ensure financial documentation accuracy above 98%\",\"Provide timely administrative support for finance operations\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"I\'ve made sure our front desk runs like clockwork, keeping visitor records 100% accurate and up to date. On the finance side, I pay close attention to detail to keep our documentation accuracy well above the 98% mark. I always aim to handle admin requests for the finance team quickly so that operations don\'t get delayed.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_2\",\"text\":\"Front Desk Office Supplies & Task Execution\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Admin/HR 1 (Front Desk & Account Support)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure 100% professional demeanour and appearance at all times\",\"Timeliness in restocking of office supplies\"],\"comments\":\"As the first point of contact for the office, I keep my presentation and attitude highly professional at all times. To keep the office running smoothly, I don\'t wait for things to run out; I keep a close eye on our supply levels and restock everything proactively so the team always has what they need.\",\"selfScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"comments\":\"I take real ownership of my desk and the day-to-day front office tasks. If a scheduling conflict or admin issue pops up, I handle it immediately instead of passing it off. I try to lead by example, staying organized and punctual so the rest of the team feels supported to do the same\",\"selfScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"comments\":\"I don\'t sit back and wait for instructions when a problem arises. Whether it\'s chasing down missing paperwork or resolving a supply delay, I keep pushing and follow up consistently until the issue is sorted out and our daily workflow is back on track\",\"selfScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"comments\":\"I make sure my communication is clear, polite, and direct, whether I’m talking to visitors, suppliers, or colleagues. I focus on listening carefully to what people actually need, which has helped me build strong, easy working relationships across different departments.\",\"selfScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"comments\":\"My attendance and punctuality are solid I\'m always at my desk early to make sure everything is set up and ready before the day starts. I take work ethic seriously, especially when it comes to keeping sensitive financial documents and visitor information completely confidential\",\"selfScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"comments\":\"I work closely with support team members to make sure they know exactly what\'s expected of them. I keep track of how we are doing and give direct, helpful feedback on the go to help them improve their accuracy and keep our admin support strong.\",\"selfScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"comments\":\"I actively look for ways to grow and bring more value to the team. Recently, I have focused on building my industry knowledge by completing professional self-study, including an Introduction to Supply Chain Management course on Alison. I’ve also spent time improving how I handle our daily reporting and tracking templates to make our administrative and financial data processing much faster and more accurate.\",\"selfScore\":5}]','2026-07-15 15:47:30.000','To apply my recent supply chain training to find ways to optimize our physical asset tracking and inventory workflows.\\n​Work on streamlining our daily reports and administrative files to save time and reduce manual errors.\\n​Enroll in and complete further professional logistics training specifically targeting Logistics Management and Inventory Control, and a Diploma in Logistics to build my operational skills.\\n​Take on more coordination tasks to help streamline how information flows between the front desk and the finance/operations teams.'),
('REV001EMP017','EMP017','Edith Abosede Friday','Marketing 6 (Sales Closer)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','In summary, I have been able achieve a certain height in this field and I look forward to achieving more even as I enhance my skills in order to contribute more effectively.','Edith is highly intentional about driving and closing sales. She consistently follows up with clients until deals are concluded and has demonstrated strong commitment to achieving results. However, she needs to learn more tolerance.','Edith has demonstrated strong commitment to achieving results and has made positive contributions during the review period. HR encourages her to continue building on her sales performance while developing greater patience and emotional intelligence in her interactions with colleagues and clients. Continued learning and skill development will further support her growth and success in the role.',8.879999999999999,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_MARKETING_15\",\"text\":\"Sales Deal Closure\",\"weight\":40,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Marketing 6 (Sales Closer)\"],\"description\":[\"Revenue generated across business units\",\"Lead-to-sale conversion rate (This will be based on the amount communicated per time)\",\"Client retention, repeat business, and referrals\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"The total of 11,250,625 has been generated across business units, amount communicated per time is usually base on client itinerary, few clients came back.\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"\\nI actively guide my colleagues, sharing insights and best practices to foster a collaborative environment.\\n\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"comments\":\"I am committed to taking initiative in resolving issues before they escalate, demonstrating a proactive attitude in my work.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"As a good listener, I also encourage feedback to enhance communication.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I adhere strictly to every code of conduct, and I\'m committed to carrying out my work dutifully.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I offer constructive feedback to support the achievement of goals.\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"comments\":\"\\n\\nI aim to set personal development goals that align with this organization\'s objectives. I will actively seek feedback and look for opportunities to learn and grow. Additionally, I plan to complete relevant training courses and pursue professional certifications to enhance my skills and contribute more effectively to the team.\\n\\n\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":3}]','2026-07-20 11:13:12.000','To enhance my skills and work more effectively in achieving more results.'),
('REV001EMP018','EMP018','Chijioke David Somtochukwu','NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','A very satisfactory Effort is being put into the job and I’m open to being better.','During the review period, the employee showed steady performance and commitment to achieving operational goals. He worked collaboratively with colleagues, supported drivers effectively, and demonstrated a strong desire for self-improvement. Continued investment in skill development will enhance his overall contribution and prepare him for greater responsibilities.','The employee demonstrated commitment and steady performance during the review period. HR encourages him to continue developing his skills, maintain effective support for drivers, and focus on improving fleet efficiency. Continued learning and consistency will prepare him for greater responsibilities and enhance his overall contribution to the organization.',8.4775,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_7\",\"text\":\"Vehicle Utilization & Efficiency\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Fleet Utilization Rate: Increased by 30% Percent due to proper monitoring and frequent call outs\",\"30% Reduction in Idle Time: Decrease in unnecessary vehicle idling time\"],\"comments\":\"As a fleet monitoring officer, I\'ve boosted fleet utilization through diligent monitoring and timely call-outs, while also cutting vehicle idle time to enhance efficiency.\",\"selfScore\":100,\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"Displayed diligence and commitment to fleet monitoring, contributing to improved fleet utilization and reduced vehicle idle time through timely interventions and effective oversight.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_8\",\"text\":\"Driver Performance & Safety\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Driver Compliance Rate: Increase the number of averted risks due 