compliance, early issue detection, and reduced operational risks.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"comments\":\"As a fleet monitoring officer, I embody strong leadership by demonstrating unwavering responsibility I also try to lead by example, guiding colleagues effectively, and consistently maintain accountability for all crucial deliverables.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Displayed strong leadership and accountability by taking ownership of responsibilities, leading by example, and providing guidance to colleagues. His commitment and reliability contribute positively to team performance and operational success.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"comments\":\"As a fleet monitoring officer, I take the lead in tackling problems with the instruction from my supervisor I\'m determined to overcome any challenges and actively pursue enhancements to our operational processes.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Displayed initiative and problem-solving skills by effectively addressing operational challenges and supporting process improvements under supervision. His willingness to take action contributes positively to operational efficiency and team performance.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"As a fleet monitoring officer, I ensure clear communication with my team and supervisor, actively listen to feedback, and foster strong, collaborative working relationships to achieve our goals.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Displayed effective communication and teamwork by maintaining clear interactions with team members and supervisors, actively seeking feedback, and fostering collaborative relationships that support the achievement of team goals.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"comments\":\"As a fleet monitoring officer, I am highly reliable and committed to my work, always punctual and present, and strictly adhere to all corporate codes of conduct.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":3,\"managerFeedback\":\"Displayed a strong work ethic through reliability, commitment, and consistent punctuality. He adheres strictly to company policies and the code of conduct while carrying out his responsibilities with professionalism and dedication.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"comments\":\"We all have our specific jobs and goals, and we work together, watching out for each other, and helping each other improve so we can all succeed.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Displayed strong teamwork and collaboration by supporting colleagues, sharing knowledge, and fostering a cooperative work environment that contributed to the achievement of team goals and overall success.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"comments\":\"As a fleet monitoring officer, I ensure my goals align with organizational objectives. And being open to learn more and get certifications pertaining to the job.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Displayed a strong commitment to personal and professional development by aligning personal goals with organizational objectives and actively pursuing learning opportunities and relevant certifications to enhance job performance.\"}]','2026-07-20 12:14:41.000','Enhancing fleet efficiency and making sure that the drivers are in safe hands and given so much attention so that they can do the job well.'),
