('REV001EMP020','EMP020','Oluwatobiloba Olateju','ERP/IT 1 (ERP/IT Officer)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','Overall i am still improving in my performance, while i remained committed to my responsibility, maintain a positive work ethic and contribute to the achievement of my team and organization. And also push my self to to go extra mile on my responsibilities.','The employee has demonstrated a positive attitude, reliability, and commitment to assigned responsibilities throughout the review period. Performance has consistently met expectations, with strengths in teamwork, communication, accountability, and adaptability. The employee contributes positively to departmental objectives and is receptive to feedback. Continued focus on expanding technical expertise, taking greater initiative in process improvements, and strengthening leadership capabilities will support continued professional growth and increased organizational impact.','The employee has demonstrated consistent performance and a positive attitude throughout the review period. HR encourages continued development of technical skills, particularly in the ERP system, while taking greater initiative in improving processes and building leadership capabilities. This commitment to continuous learning will support both personal growth and the organization\'s success.',8.014999999999999,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_ERP_IT_1\",\"text\":\"ERP System Adoption\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"ERP/IT 1 (ERP/IT Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Percentage of employees actively using the enterprise system\",\"Percentage of time internet services are available in the office without interruptions\",\"Percentage of IT Incidents Resolved within First Attempt without the need for escalation\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"comments\":\"I have learn the ERP system and its features and i am applying it as needed \",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"Regularly used the ERP system and completed assigned tasks accurately. Occasionally required guidance but generally demonstrated good system adoption.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_ERP_IT_2\",\"text\":\"ERP Upgrades & Implementations\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"ERP/IT 1 (ERP/IT Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Percentage of Successful ERP Upgrades & System Implementations\"],\"selfScore\":50,\"comments\":\"I am actively supporting the ERP upgrade and implementation process.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"Quickly adapted to system upgrades, followed new procedures effectively, and actively supported implementation with minimal disruption.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I constantly take ownership of my responsibility and supporting my colleague when needed \",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Consistently meets expectations, accepts responsibility for assigned tasks, and collaborates effectively with the team.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I take initiative by identifying tasks that need attention and completing them with minimal supervisions \",\"managerFeedback\":\"Shows persistence in completing assigned tasks and remains committed to achieving expected outcomes despite challenges. Going forward, greater proactiveness in identifying process improvement opportunities and taking ownership of broader initiatives will further strengthen performance.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I maintain effective communication with my colleague and work well in a team   \",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Communicates clearly and professionally with colleagues and stakeholders while maintaining positive working relationships.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I consistently demonstrate a strong work ethic by being responsible and committed to delivering quality work \",\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrates a strong work ethic through reliability, commitment, and consistent adherence to organizational policies. Maintains good attendance and punctuality while delivering assigned responsibilities responsibly and with a positive attitude.\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"comments\":\"I support the development of key performance indicator by understanding team objective and aligning my work with the organizational goal  \",\"selfScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrates a good understanding of key performance expectations and is receptive to feedback.\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"comments\":\"I am committed to continues learning and professional development by actively seeking opportunities to improve my knowledge and skills  \",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"Demonstrates a positive attitude toward continuous learning and professional development. Actively seeks opportunities to improve knowledge and skills while applying new learning to enhance job performance.\"}]','2026-07-20 12:29:10.000','I plan to continue developing my technical and professional skills particularly on the ERP and also outside the ERP system to improve in how i can provide better solutions and help in organizational growth'),
