('REV001EMP022','EMP022','Idowu Aina Victoria','NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','Maintained effective fleet operations through proactive vehicle and driver monitoring, timely reporting, prompt alarm response,and continuous efforts to improve vehicle utilization, safety and operational efficiency.','She has demonstrated strong commitment to effective fleet operations through proactive vehicle and driver monitoring, timely reporting, prompt alarm response, and effective escalation of operational issues. Her accountability, reliability, and collaborative approach have contributed positively to improved vehicle safety, utilization, compliance, and operational efficiency.\n\nGoing forward, she is encouraged to continue enhancing fleet performance by strengthening monitoring processes, reducing safety violations and idle time, and leveraging data-driven insights to improve reporting, workflow efficiency, and overall fleet effectiveness.','The employee has demonstrated commitment to improving fleet operations during the review period. HR encourages her to continue strengthening fleet monitoring, ensuring timely and accurate reporting, and using data to improve operational efficiency. Continued focus on safety, compliance, and process improvement will enhance her overall contribution to the organization.',8.6,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_7\",\"text\":\"Vehicle Utilization & Efficiency\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Fleet Utilization Rate: Increased by 30% Percent due to proper monitoring and frequent call outs\",\"30% Reduction in Idle Time: Decrease in unnecessary vehicle idling time\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Successful improved fleet Utilization by proactive vehicle monitoring, effective scheduling and prompt response to operational call out.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has successfully improved fleet utilization through proactive vehicle monitoring, effective scheduling, and prompt response to operational call-outs. Her commitment and responsiveness have contributed positively to fleet efficiency and smooth operations.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_8\",\"text\":\"Driver Performance & Safety\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Driver Compliance Rate: Increase the number of averted risks due to call-outs\",\"Number of Violations: Reduce cases of speeding, harsh braking, and long parking\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Maintained close monitoring of drivers performance, conducted timely intervention to avert potential risks.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has maintained close monitoring of drivers’ performance and carried out timely interventions to mitigate potential risks. \\nHer proactive approach has supported safer operations and improved driver accountability.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_9\",\"text\":\"Reporting & Monitoring Accuracy\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Report Timeliness: Percentage of reports submitted on time (daily, weekly, monthly)\",\"Data Accuracy Rate: Accuracy and reliability of fleet reports generated\",\"Incident Reporting Response Time: Average time taken to detect and escalate issues\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Maintained timely submission of fleet reports with accurate and reliable data. Promptly identified and escalated incidents, ensuring effective monitoring and supporting operational efficiency.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"She consistently maintained timely submission of fleet reports with accurate and reliable data. Her prompt identification and escalation of incidents have supported effective monitoring, improved decision-making, and enhanced operational efficiency.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_10\",\"text\":\"Alarm Detection & Monitoring\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Alarm Detection & Monitoring\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Consistently monitored fleet alarms, responded promptly to critical alerts, and escalated issues as required to enhance vehicle safety, compliance and operational efficiency.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has demonstrated strong commitment in monitoring fleet alarms, responding promptly to critical alerts, and escalating issues appropriately. Her proactive approach has contributed positively to improved vehicle safety, compliance, and operational efficiency.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Maintained accountability for deliverables, led by example and collaborated effectively with colleagues to achieve operational goals.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has demonstrated accountability for deliverables, led by example, and collaborated effectively with colleagues to achieve operational goals. Her commitment and teamwork have contributed positively to overall operational performance.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Proactive resolve operational issues, remained persistent in overcoming challenges, and continuously identified opportunities to improve fleet monitoring, reporting and work flow efficiency.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has demonstrated a proactive approach in resolving operational issues, overcoming challenges, and identifying opportunities to improve fleet monitoring, reporting, and workflow efficiency. Her persistence and commitment have contributed positively to operational improvements.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Communication effectively with my team members and positive working relationships and collaborated efficiently to resolve operational issues and achieve fleet objectives.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has communicated effectively with team members, built positive working relationships, and collaborated efficiently to resolve operational issues and achieve fleet objectives. Her teamwork and interpersonal skills have contributed positively to operational success.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Maintained excellent attendance, demonstrate reliability in completing assigned tasks and consistently complied with company policies and professional standards.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"She consistently demonstrates reliability, punctuality, and a strong sense of responsibility in carrying out assigned tasks. Her adherence to company policies and professional standards reflects her commitment to maintaining operational excellence.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I supported my colleague by sharing operational guidance, Communicating expectations during daily activities,and assisting with onboarding and knowledge sharing where required.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has demonstrated a willingness to support colleagues by sharing operational guidance, communicating expectations effectively, and assisting with onboarding and knowledge sharing. Her collaborative approach has contributed to improved teamwork and operational effectiveness.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Actively pursued continuous learning, sought constructive feedback,and applied new knowledge to improve performance and support organizational goals.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has demonstrated a strong commitment to continuous learning by seeking constructive feedback and applying new knowledge to improve her performance. Her growth mindset has positively supported both her personal development and organizational goals.\"}]','2026-07-20 12:32:15.000','Continue to improve fleet efficiency by enhancing vehicle and driver monitoring, reducing safety violations and idle time, ensuring timely reporting.'),
('REV001EMP023','EMP023','Akorede Sandra Bisola','Legal 1 (Legal Counsel & EA)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','My performance has been highly satisfactory — I’ve consistently delivered quality work as Legal Counsel/Executive Assistant.\n\nKey Highlights:\n - Quashed challenging tasks with impressive results\n - Ensured seamless operations and exceeded expectations\n\nCareer Development Goals:\n - Continue tackling high-impact projects with excellence\n - Receive formal recognition for hard work and contributions\n - Advance my skills, drive growth, and increase income\n\nLooking Forward: To keep delivering value and growing in my role','Sandra is very proactive, self driven and have a high level of task completion. She also has a great attitude to work','',8.61,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_LEGAL_1\",\"text\":\"Regulatory Compliance & Deadlines\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Legal 1 (Legal Counsel & EA)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain 100% compliance with required regulatory filings and legal documentation deadlines\",\"Achieve 95%+ timeliness in responding to executive and legal requests\",\"Ensure accurate documentation and secure handling of confidential information\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"managerScore\":70},{\"id\":\"OBJ_LEGAL_2\",\"text\":\"Executive Action Item Follow-Up\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Legal 1 (Legal Counsel & EA)\"],\"description\":[\"Provide timely coordination and follow-up on executive action items\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":3},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4}]','2026-07-28 11:06:43.000','Career Development Goals & Actions for Next Review Cycle\n\n1. Continue tackling high-impact projects with excellence\n - Actions:\n - Take on at least 2 high-priority projects in the next quarter\n - Deliver all projects on or before deadline\n - Share outcomes with management for visibility\n\n2. Receive formal recognition for hard work and contributions\n - Actions:\n - Document key contributions and impact in quarterly reports\n - Request feedback sessions with supervisor bi-monthly\n - Discuss career progression and recognition opportunities with management\n\n3. Advance my skills, drive growth, and increase income\n - Actions:\n - Enroll in 1 advanced legal/leadership course (e.g., via Coursera, Lagos Business School)\n - Complete NYSC requirements and leverage the experience for professional growth\n - Follow up on tasks assigned to the management team to ensure timely completion and drive project progress\n - Explore performance-based incentives or salary review with management '),
('REV001EMP024','EMP024','Sanusi Hamid Agboworin','Workshop 3 (Workshop Manager)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Submitted','I think for the Past six months we try all our possible best to make sure they did not tow any of our vehicle to a lastma office due to a  quick response of the Team and also there\'s no any casualty at the workshop for the past six month','',NULL,2.6999999999999997,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_WORKSHOP_3\",\"text\":\"Repair Turnaround Time & Availability\",\"weight\":40,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Workshop 3 (Workshop Manager)\"],\"description\":[\"Quality of completed jobs and reduction in repeat faults\",\"Ensure fleet and workshop equipment availability remains at or above 90%\",\"Ensure 100% compliance with safety and maintenance standards\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"100% Safety compliance,for the past 6month no any casualty records at the workshop \",\"managerScore\":70},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":4}]','2026-07-21 14:07:06.000','My Goal is to minimize the rate of the repairs coming to the workshop during this Raining season by engaging the Driver on what to do when they are approaching flood Area'),
('REV001EMP025','EMP025','David Mbacha','ERP/IT 1 (ERP/IT Officer)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Draft','',NULL,NULL,0,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_ERP_IT_1\",\"text\":\"ERP System Adoption\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"ERP/IT 1 (ERP/IT Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Percentage of employees actively using the enterprise system\",\"Percentage of time internet services are available in the office without interruptions\",\"Percentage of IT Incidents Resolved within First Attempt without the need for escalation\"],\"selfScore\":0},{\"id\":\"OBJ_ERP_IT_2\",\"text\":\"ERP Upgrades & Implementations\",\"weight\":20,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"ERP/IT 1 (ERP/IT Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Percentage of Successful ERP Upgrades & System Implementations\"]},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"]},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"]},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"]},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"]},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"]},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"]}]','2026-07-17 10:31:25.000',''),
('REV001EMP026','EMP026','Victoria Aghogho Otojareri','Finance 1 (Acc Payable)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','During this review period, I consistently carried out my responsibilities as an accounts payable officer by processing vendor payments accurately, supporting statutory remittances, preparing reports and performing reconcilations. I maintained a high level of accountability, attention to detail and professionalism while collaborating effectively with colleagues across departments. Going forward, I aim to further improve my analytical skills, strengthen my expertise in financial reporting and automation, and contribute more effectively to process improvements within the finance function.','she need to take a course on cashflow management and data analysis','The employee has demonstrated a commitment to continuous learning and professional growth. HR supports the proposed development goals and encourages further training in cash flow management and data analysis to strengthen financial reporting, process improvement, and overall effectiveness in the role.',8.411,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_1\",\"text\":\"Payment Timeliness & Accuracy\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Finance 1 (Acc Payable)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure 100% of approved payments are processed within 24–72 hours of approval\",\"Maintain payment processing accuracy rate of 98–100%\",\"Record zero unauthorized or duplicate payments\"],\"comments\":\"Processed approved vendor payments promptly after recieving management approvals while maintaining a high level of accuracy . Ensured all payments followed the required approval workflow, with no unauthorized or duplicate payments recorded. Regularly followed up on pending approvals to prevent delays in vendor payments\",\"selfScore\":100,\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"she is good in following up with payment\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_2\",\"text\":\"Payables Management\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Finance 1 (Acc Payable)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain 100% accurate accounts payable records\",\"Ensure at least 90–95% of vendor payments are made within agreed terms\",\"Keep overdue payables within acceptable thresholds\"],\"comments\":\"Maintained accurate accounts payable records and ensured vendor payments were processes in line with company procedures and agreed timelines. Monitored outstanding payment requests and communicated with relevant departments to facilitate timely settlement of vendor obligations.\",\"selfScore\":100,\"managerFeedback\":\"she sent weekly payment record to GM\",\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_3\",\"text\":\"Statutory Compliance\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Finance 1 (Acc Payable)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure 100% timely remittance of statutory deductions (PAYE, VAT, pension, HMO, etc.)\",\"Maintain zero penalties arising from late or incorrect tax filings\",\"Ensure 100% accuracy in tax reporting and documentation\"],\"comments\":\"Successfully processed and uploaded statutory payments including PAYE, Pension and other regulatory remittances within scheduled timelines. Maintained accurate documentation and resolved issues encountered during pension uploads to ensure successful submission and compliance.\",\"selfScore\":100,\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"I agreed with her\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_4\",\"text\":\"Financial Reporting\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Finance 1 (Acc Payable)\"],\"description\":[\"Submit 100% of financial reports on schedule (weekly/monthly)\",\"Maintain 98–100% accuracy in financial statements and payable reports\"],\"comments\":\"Prepared and submitted monthly accounts payable reports and expenses analyses within reporting deadlines. Supported financial reporting through bank statement reconciliations and maintained accurate records that contributed to management reporting.\",\"selfScore\":100,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\",\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_5\",\"text\":\"Reconciliation & Audit Readiness\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Finance 1 (Acc Payable)\"],\"description\":[\"Complete monthly vendor reconciliations with zero unresolved discrepancies beyond one reporting cycle\",\"Maintain 100% audit-ready documentation for all payments and statutory remittances\"],\"comments\":\"Performed bank statement reconciliations and maintained organized payment documentation to support audit readiness. Ensured payment records and supporting documents were complete and easily retrievable whenever required.\",\"selfScore\":100,\"managerFeedback\":\"she has documents for audit purpose\",\"managerScore\":50},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_6\",\"text\":\"Expense Monitoring & Control\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Finance 1 (Acc Payable)\"],\"description\":[\"Identify and report at least 3–5 cost or process improvement opportunities annually\",\"Ensure 100% proper classification of transactions (approved, pending, paid)\",\"Perform other duties as assigned by management\"],\"comments\":\"Maintained proper classification and tracking of payment transactions through the worksuite system. \",\"selfScore\":100,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\",\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"comments\":\"Took ownership of assigned responsibilities by ensuring payment requests were processed accurately and on time. Remained dependable in handling sensitive financial transactions while maintaining confidentiality and accountability .\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"comments\":\"Demonstrated initiative by proactively following up on pending approvals to minimize payment delays. Identified and resolved issues during statutory payment uploads, Ensuring work was completed accurately despite challanges \",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"she is trying to minimise payment delays and prompt payment\",\"managerScore\":3},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"comments\":\"Maintained professional communication with colleagues, management and vendors regarding payment status and documentation requirements. Worked collaboratively with different departments to ensure smooth payment processing.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"she has started communicating well with team members\",\"managerScore\":3},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"comments\":\"Maintained punctuality, reliability and professionalism through the review period. Adhered to company policies, demonstrated integrity in handling financial information and consistently completed assigned responsibilities.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"she demonstrate high level of consistency and reliability\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"comments\":\"Not applicable to my current role. However, I actively support team objectives by collaborating effectively, sharing relevant information and contributing to the achievement of departmental goals\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"she handles payments and sent the receipts to the appropriate channels.\",\"managerScore\":3},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"comments\":\"Continued to strengthen my knowledge of accounts payable processes, Excel and financial reporting. Sought feedback from my line manager to improve efficiency and accuracy while remaining committed to continuous professional development\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"she has started financial modelling course\",\"managerScore\":4}]','2026-07-20 12:34:48.000','1. Improve advanced Excel and financial analysis skills to enhance reporting efficiency.\\n2. Continue to strengthen my knowledge of accounts payable control and statutory compliance.\\n3. Contribute ideas that improve payment processes and reduce processing time.\\n4. Expand knowledge of financial reporting system and automation tools to increase productivity.'),
('REV001EMP027','EMP027','Melissa Onwuanaku','NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','Throughout the review period, I consistently demonstrated accountability, professionalism, and a results-driven approach by improving fleet utilization, enhancing driver safety and compliance, ensuring accurate and timely reporting, proactively monitoring fleet operations, and responding promptly to operational issues. I effectively supported and coached team members, fostered collaboration, maintained high ethical standards, and remained committed to continuous learning and process improvement. These efforts contributed to improved operational efficiency, safer fleet operations, and the successful achievement of departmental and organizational objectives.','She has demonstrated strong accountability, professionalism, and commitment to operational excellence through effective fleet monitoring, improved vehicle utilization, enhanced driver safety, accurate reporting, and prompt response to operational issues. Her strengths in teamwork, problem-solving, and continuous improvement have contributed positively to fleet performance and organizational goals.\n\nGoing forward, she should continue strengthening data-driven decision-making, driver coaching, reporting efficiency, and leadership skills to further improve operational effectiveness.','The employee has demonstrated a clear commitment to continuous improvement and professional growth. The development goals outlined are well aligned with the role and the organization\'s objectives. HR encourages the employee to continue strengthening leadership, data analysis, reporting, and fleet management capabilities while maintaining a focus on safety, compliance, and operational excellence.',8.465,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_7\",\"text\":\"Vehicle Utilization & Efficiency\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Fleet Utilization Rate: Increased by 30% Percent due to proper monitoring and frequent call outs\",\"30% Reduction in Idle Time: Decrease in unnecessary vehicle idling time\"],\"comments\":\"I proactively monitored fleet operations and ensured timely vehicle deployment through frequent follow-ups and call-outs, resulting in a 30% increase in fleet utilization. I also focused on reducing unnecessary vehicle idle time by 30%, improving operational efficiency, optimizing resource utilization, and supporting overall productivity.\",\"selfScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has demonstrated strong initiative in proactively monitoring fleet operations and ensuring timely vehicle deployment through consistent follow-ups and call-outs. Her efforts have contributed to improved fleet utilization, reduced idle time, optimized resource allocation, and enhanced overall operational productivity. Her commitment to efficiency and continuous improvement is highly commendable.\",\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_8\",\"text\":\"Driver Performance & Safety\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Driver Compliance Rate: Increase the number of averted risks due to call-outs\",\"Number of Violations: Reduce cases of speeding, harsh braking, and long parking\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Throughout the review period, I remained committed to improving driver performance and promoting a strong safety culture across fleet operations. I maintained close monitoring of driver activities and conducted timely call-outs whenever unsafe driving behaviours or compliance issues were identified. This proactive approach helped increase driver compliance by addressing potential risks before they escalated into incidents.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has demonstrated strong commitment to improving driver performance and promoting safety through consistent monitoring, timely interventions, and proactive call-outs. Her efforts have contributed to improved driver compliance and reduced operational risks.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_9\",\"text\":\"Reporting & Monitoring Accuracy\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Report Timeliness: Percentage of reports submitted on time (daily, weekly, monthly)\",\"Data Accuracy Rate: Accuracy and reliability of fleet reports generated\",\"Incident Reporting Response Time: Average time taken to detect and escalate issues\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"During the review period, I consistently ensured that all daily, weekly, and monthly fleet reports were prepared and submitted on time, supporting effective decision-making and operational planning. I maintained a high level of accuracy in fleet reporting by carefully validating data, monitoring vehicle activities, and ensuring that reports were complete, reliable, and reflective of actual fleet performance.\\n\\nI also demonstrated prompt responsiveness in identifying and escalating operational incidents, enabling timely intervention and minimizing the impact of potential disruptions. Through continuous monitoring, attention to detail, and effective communication with relevant stakeholders, I contributed to improved reporting standards, enhanced operational visibility, and more efficient fleet management.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has consistently delivered accurate and timely fleet reports, ensuring effective operational visibility and decision-making. Her attention to detail, prompt incident escalation, and clear communication have contributed to improved fleet management and operational efficiency.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_NOC_10\",\"text\":\"Alarm Detection & Monitoring\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"NOC 2 (Fleet Monitoring Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Alarm Detection & Monitoring\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"Throughout the review period, I maintained continuous monitoring of fleet alarms and system alerts to ensure timely identification and resolution of operational issues. I responded promptly to vehicle alarms, investigated the root causes, and escalated critical incidents where necessary to minimize operational disruptions and mitigate potential risks.\\n\\nBy proactively monitoring alarm notifications and following up on all reported issues, I contributed to improved fleet reliability, enhanced vehicle security, and increased operational efficiency. My consistent attention to alarm management ensured that potential concerns were addressed promptly, reducing downtime and supporting safe and compliant fleet operations.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has consistently demonstrated effective fleet alarm monitoring, prompt response to alerts, and timely escalation of critical issues. Her proactive approach has improved vehicle security, reduced operational risks, and supported safe and efficient fleet operations.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Throughout the review period, I consistently demonstrated a strong sense of responsibility and ownership by ensuring that assigned tasks were completed accurately, on time, and in line with organizational expectations. I remained accountable for my deliverables, proactively addressed challenges, and followed through on responsibilities to achieve desired outcomes.\\n\\nI led by example through professionalism, integrity, and a positive work ethic, while providing guidance and support to colleagues whenever needed. I fostered collaboration, encouraged adherence to operational standards, and maintained open communication to ensure team objectives were achieved. My commitment to accountability and continuous improvement contributed to a more efficient, reliable, and high-performing work environment.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has demonstrated strong accountability, ownership, and professionalism in delivering assigned tasks. Her ability to lead by example, support colleagues, and maintain effective collaboration has contributed positively to team performance and operational success.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"consistently demonstrated initiative by proactively identifying operational issues and taking timely action to resolve them without waiting for direction. I remained focused on delivering results, even when faced with challenges, by analyzing problems, exploring practical solutions, and following through until issues were resolved.\\n\\nI also sought opportunities to improve existing workflows by recommending and implementing more efficient monitoring and reporting practices that enhanced fleet operations. My willingness to take ownership, adapt to changing situations, and continuously look for process improvements contributed to increased operational efficiency, reduced delays, and better overall team performance.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has demonstrated strong initiative and problem-solving skills by proactively identifying and resolving operational issues. Her ability to recommend improvements, adapt to challenges, and enhance monitoring and reporting processes has contributed positively to operational efficiency and team performance.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"maintained clear, professional, and effective communication with team members, drivers, and other stakeholders to ensure smooth coordination of fleet operations. I provided timely updates, escalated issues appropriately, and shared accurate information to support informed decision-making and efficient execution of tasks.\\n\\nI actively listened to feedback, collaborated effectively with colleagues, and maintained positive working relationships built on mutual respect and trust. By fostering open communication and teamwork, I contributed to a cooperative work environment, improved problem resolution, and the successful achievement of team and organizational objectives.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has demonstrated effective communication and collaboration with team members, drivers, and stakeholders. Her timely updates, proper escalation of issues, and positive working relationships have contributed to improved coordination, problem resolution, and achievement of operational objectives.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I demonstrated a strong work ethic by consistently carrying out my responsibilities with dedication, professionalism, and a high level of reliability. I remained committed to meeting deadlines, delivering quality work, and supporting the smooth operation of fleet activities, even under demanding conditions.\\n\\nI maintained good punctuality and attendance, ensuring I was available to effectively monitor operations and respond promptly to operational needs. I also adhered strictly to the organization’s policies, procedures, and code of conduct, conducting myself with integrity, discipline, and respect in all interactions. My commitment to professionalism and accountability contributed to a productive work environment and reinforced the organization’s operational standards.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has consistently demonstrated a strong work ethic, reliability, and professionalism in executing her responsibilities. Her punctuality, adherence to company standards, and commitment to quality work have positively contributed to effective fleet operations.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"comments\":\" I effectively deployed and communicated KPIs to team members, ensuring that performance expectations and individual responsibilities were clearly understood and aligned with departmental objectives. I regularly monitored team performance, tracked progress against set targets, and maintained open communication to ensure accountability and consistent performance.\\n\\nI provided timely feedback, guidance, and coaching to help team members overcome challenges, improve performance, and achieve their assigned KPIs. By fostering a supportive and results-driven work environment, I encouraged continuous improvement, strengthened team accountability, and contributed to the successful achievement of operational goals.\",\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has demonstrated effective leadership in communicating KPIs, monitoring team performance, and providing timely feedback and coaching. Her efforts have strengthened accountability, encouraged continuous improvement, and supported the achievement of departmental goals.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I remained committed to my personal and professional development by setting improvement goals that aligned with the organization’s objectives and the demands of my role. I actively sought feedback from supervisors and colleagues, using it to strengthen my skills, improve my performance, and enhance my contribution to the team.\\n\\nI embraced learning opportunities by participating in relevant training sessions and continuously expanding my knowledge of fleet operations, monitoring systems, and best practices. I also applied the knowledge gained to improve work processes, increase efficiency, and support better operational outcomes. My commitment to continuous learning has strengthened my ability to adapt, take on new responsibilities, and contribute more effectively to the organization’s success.\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"She has demonstrated a strong commitment to continuous learning and professional development by seeking feedback, embracing learning opportunities, and applying new knowledge to improve performance. Her growth mindset has positively contributed to operational improvements and organizational goals.\"}]','2026-07-20 12:39:07.000','Going forward, I will focus on further enhancing fleet performance by leveraging data analytics to identify trends, improve vehicle utilization, and strengthen proactive decision-making. I will continue to improve driver safety and compliance through regular coaching, closer monitoring, and timely interventions to further reduce operational risks and violations.\n\nI also plan to enhance the quality and efficiency of reporting by improving data validation processes and reducing incident response times. Additionally, I will strengthen my leadership and coaching capabilities by providing more structured performance feedback, mentoring team members, and fostering a culture of accountability and continuous improvement. To support my professional growth, I will actively pursue relevant training and certifications, stay updated on industry best practices, and seek opportunities to improve operational processes that contribute to the organization’s strategic objectives.'),
('REV001EMP028','EMP028','Bejamin Abe','Internal Control 1 (Internal Control)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','My performance over the past few months has been top notch, and whereby i make sure to bring escalation to the barest minimum and making sure there is effectiveness and efficiency in my work with high level of teamwork with colleagues.','good at what he is doing','The employee has demonstrated good performance and a willingness to grow. HR encourages continued commitment to learning, stronger teamwork, timely reporting, and consistently taking initiative. Maintaining this positive attitude while building new skills will further enhance performance and contribute to the organization\'s success.',9.102249999999998,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"comments\":\"*Demonstration of responsibility and ownership of task outcomes is situation whereby i took full ownership and responsibility on document renewal and making sure vehicles are been repaired within a timely manner.\\n*Leading by example and guiding colleagues has to deal with where by i had to myself to stand as an image for the organization to lead and guide both senior and co- worker on taking responsibility on their jobs\\n*accountablity isnt just all about been help accountable for a takes, its involve been at the forefront of a task showing how competence and efficient the individual is, which is what i have portrait over time.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"took responsibility and ownership of vehicles documents\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"comments\":\"*Proactive problem-solving is all about solving problems before they escalate, reducing downtime, and preventing costly mistakes. It demonstrates accountability, initiative, and a solution‑oriented mindset, which can improve your reputation and performance reviews and all this happened in making sure that is timely inspection and maintaining been cared out on every vehicle before it get worse.\\n*persist has to deal with been able to survive under various circumstance like pressure to be efficient and striving under an unfavourable condition to achieve ones goal.\\n*improvising and bringing up innovative idea to ease up work process and approval process for document renewal and repairs payments\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"creation of filling system for documentation and excel creation for all regions documentation\",\"managerScore\":3},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"comments\":\"*In communicate / communicate skills is highly important and unavoidable as that is what create a good work flow and effectiveness and also effeciency of a worker\\n*Attentive to details and cooperating well with others is very important and they are interwoven because an information must have been acctively digestion and needed to actively done with a team to achieve ones given task and goal\\n*Building constructive working relationships is essential for enhancing productivity, job satisfaction, and overall workplace dynamics.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"good team member\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"comments\":\"*show high reliability and commitment to work task:-High reliability and commitment are demonstrated through consistent punctuality, meeting deadlines, delivering quality work, taking ownership of responsibilities, and going above and beyond to support team and organizational goals\\n*maintain consistence punctuality and attendance will enable ones task to be done within a timely manner and enable better work effeciency and effectiveness\\n*Adhere strictly to corporate code of conduct will enable proper professionalism at work , just like a saying that say DRESS THE WAY YOU WANT TO BE ADDRESS\\n\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"highly committed to work\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"comments\":\"*Clearly define and assign key performance indicator enable me to know identify my daily task, ways towards achieving my daily task, and how to be effective in meeting up with my KPI\\n*Regular monitor and evaluation team member is what i do on a weekly bases where by i access myself on task achieved , the manner and approach used in achieving the task.\\n*Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets has deal with areas where by superior create a flour for feed backs and how to make sure that  team members are been trained/coached on how to work without costing the company any lose of property or fines\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"comments\":\"*personal development on taking online course and a part time course to enhance ones skill and knowledge on the job\\n*Been seeking feedback and having the opprotunities to learn are considered as part of learning and development on the job\\n*completing training course and obtain professional certificate has been my major concern to grow personal and on the job\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"about to start taking in internal control system\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_INTERNAL_CONTROL_1\",\"text\":\"Completing Audit Reports\",\"weight\":14,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Internal Control 1 (Internal Control)\"],\"description\":[\"Completing Audit Reports\",\"Cycle time for completing Draft Audit Reports\",\"Cycle time for completing Final Audit Reports\"],\"comments\":\"*completing audit reports:- Completing an audit report involves executing final analytical procedures, evaluating uncorrected misstatements, obtaining management representations, and determining the formal audit opinion. The finalized report clearly communicates your findings, risks, and corrective actions to stakeholders so that identified issues can be addressed.\\n*cycle time involved in the completion of a drafted audit reports is 4 to 5 days \\n*cycle time involved in the completion of a audit reports is 1 to 2 weeks \",\"selfScore\":100,\"managerFeedback\":\"not applicable to his role\",\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_INTERNAL_CONTROL_2\",\"text\":\"Audit Accuracy & Fraud Detection\",\"weight\":13,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Internal Control 1 (Internal Control)\"],\"description\":[\"Number of cases of fraud issues detected by 3rd parties (External Auditors) during audit exercises (but not detected by Internal Auditors)\",\"Percentage of transport-related regulations and laws complied with\",\"Percentage of reports completed within timelines\"],\"comments\":\"*Numbers of cases involves:- disparity in invoiced figure with figure received, payment made to the wrong vendor, payment done without proper approval\\n*The percentage of transport related regulations and law comoliance is very important in the transport and logistics business as it may disrupt services, which has made me priority making sure that drivers abide by regulation and rules with a rating of 93%.\\n* reports completed within timelines is very important in every business to enable decision making and prompting good recommendation which i will rate 100%\",\"selfScore\":100,\"managerFeedback\":\"not applicable to your role\",\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_INTERNAL_CONTROL_3\",\"text\":\"Asset Utilization Optimization\",\"weight\":13,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Internal Control 1 (Internal Control)\"],\"description\":[\"Percentage of Optimal Asset Utilization\"],\"comments\":\"Asset utilization is the manner in which an organization effectively uses its assets to generate revenue and achieve operational goals. but from my findings and investigation the organisation has uptimized about 92%\",\"selfScore\":100,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\",\"managerScore\":70}]','2026-07-20 12:40:57.000','*Taking online course for self improvement, \n*Being more of a team player to ease work flow and operation, meeting up with reporting timely/deadline,\n*Going the extra mile'),
('REV001EMP029','EMP029','Queen Okonkwo','Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','I delivered on core responsibilities in invoicing  and i can say i have met deadline in submitting invoices.\nI am committed to continuous learning and contributing to the growth and efficiency of the finance team\n','She is a fast learner. she need data analysis training and e-invoicing from ICAN','The employee has demonstrated a willingness to learn and improve. HR encourages her to continue strengthening her follow-up on receivables and improving invoicing accuracy. Additional training in data analysis and ICAN e-invoicing will further enhance her technical skills and overall effectiveness in the role.',8.923499999999999,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Demonstrated ownership of all assigned tasks and ensured timely delivery of invoicing .\\ntook full responsibility for invoicing \\nsupporting my assistance in making sure all her tasks are carried out accurately\",\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Took proactive steps to resolve invoicing and reconciliation issues without waiting for instructions\\ncreated receivable tracker to monitor overdue invoices \\ni persisted by engaging IT personnel to ensure timely submission of invoice.\\nfollowing up on long outstanding customer payments and work with relevant teams to clear bottlenecks.\\n\\n\",\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"communicated clearly and professionally with team member and clients to resolve billing invoice queries \\ni also align with client on payment expectation \\ni built positive work relationships that encouraged collaboration and quick resolution of issues.\",\"managerFeedback\":\"good team member\",\"managerScore\":3},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Demonstrated high reliability and commitment to assigned tasks by meeting deadlines for invoicing \\nmaintained excellent punctuality and attendance \\nI adhere strictly to company policies and code of conducts\",\"managerFeedback\":\"good staff\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I provide timely feedback to our client, MD and team member\\nAssigned specific KPIs to my assistant ,support in generating invoices ,documentation and follow up with our client.\\n\",\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\",\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"i am currently a student of ICAN,\\ni also pursued continuous self improvement by purchasing online courses \\ni will also like to register for a course in E-invoicing to enhance my skills\",\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"she is preparing for it and taking excel course\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_10\",\"text\":\"Documentation & Compliance\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain 100% proper filing and documentation of receivables and invoice records\",\"Ensure zero audit queries arising from incomplete or missing documentation\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"Maintained proper documentation of all receivables and invoice records on my laptop\\nI also ensure all supporting documents including PO,SES,CDF,GRN,JCC were attached prior to invoicing resulting to zero audit queries relating to missing or incomplete documentation from client \\n\",\"managerFeedback\":\"her invoice preparation is timely and accurate\",\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_11\",\"text\":\"Dispute Resolution & Coordination\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)\"],\"description\":[\"Resolve at least 90% of invoice-related discrepancies within 5–7 working days\",\"Ensure 100% timely follow-up on outstanding customer balances\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"I was able to resolved invoice related discrepancies within 3-24hours meeting the deadlines\\ni reduced repeat disputes by ensuring clear communication with our client and team member\\ni created a excel receivable tracker to track my outstanding and do follow ups. \",\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\",\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_12\",\"text\":\"Cash Application & Reconciliation\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure 100% accurate posting of received payments into customer accounts\",\"Complete monthly customer account reconciliations with zero unresolved discrepancies beyond one reporting cycle\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"updating customer payment in my receivable report/tracker.\\nensured all customer receivable accounts are updated and reconciled to achieve zero outstanding\\n\\n\",\"managerFeedback\":\"timely reconciliation of invoices\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_7\",\"text\":\"Invoicing Efficiency & Accuracy\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure 100% of invoices are generated within 24–72 hours of service completion or receipt of required documentation\",\"Maintain invoice accuracy rate of 98–100% (minimal errors or rework required)\",\"Ensure 100% of invoices are supported by valid PO/SES and documentation\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"generated invoices within limited time ,achieving 90% Timeliness.\\nMaintained 90% invoice accuracy rate with minimal errors \\nI also ensured all invoices were supported by valid PO,SES,CDF,GRN,JCC and complete documentation prior to submission\\n\\n\",\"managerFeedback\":\"she prepare the invoice timely and accurately\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_8\",\"text\":\"Receivables Collection Performance\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)\"],\"description\":[\"Achieve at least 85–95% collection of receivables within agreed credit terms\",\"Maintain accounts receivable aging within approved thresholds (e.g., ≤20% beyond 30 days overdue)\",\"Reduce overdue receivables by at least 10–15% annually\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"I initiated follow up on outstanding invoices\\nI also follow up on MD if payments has been made on the invoices issued\",\"managerFeedback\":\"reduction in invoices collection date\",\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_9\",\"text\":\"Reporting Timeliness & Accuracy\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)\"],\"description\":[\"Submit weekly and monthly financial and receivables reports 100% on schedule\",\"Maintain 98–100% accuracy in financial reports and receivable schedules\",\"Ensure monthly receivable schedules are completed within the first 5 working days of each month\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"i ensure that my receivable excel tracker is updated timely \\ni also updates the receivable report of each of our client daily, weekly and monthly\\ni also updates the bus rental report\\n\",\"managerFeedback\":\"she updated the invoice tracker\",\"managerScore\":80}]','2026-07-20 12:44:34.000','To improve in my follow ups for overdue receivables.\nAlso to minimize errors during invoicing'),
('REV001EMP030','EMP030','Harriet Gbiaye','Legal 2 (Legal Counsel & PM)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Submitted','I joined the Company on 18 May 2026 and quickly adapted to the role, providing timely and practical legal support across contract management, compliance, corporate governance, property management, and dispute resolution. During the review period, I consistently met key deliverables, collaborated effectively with stakeholders, and remained committed to protecting the Company\'s legal and commercial interests. I look forward to further strengthening legal processes and contributing to the Company\'s continued growth.',NULL,NULL,3,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_LEGAL_3\",\"text\":\"Cycle time for executing contractual agreements\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Legal 2 (Legal Counsel & PM)\"],\"description\":[\"Reduce the average contract review time to 3 business days or less within the next 12 months.\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Successfully maintained a prompt turnaround time for the review and execution of contractual agreements, with most requests completed within the target timeline. Coordinated with internal stakeholders to ensure timely approvals and execution while maintaining legal accuracy and protecting the Company\'s interests.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_LEGAL_4\",\"text\":\"Cycle time for drafting agreements\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Legal 2 (Legal Counsel & PM)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain a draft accuracy rate of 95% or better, with no material errors, within the next 12 months.\",\"Reviewing contracts and drafting legal documents within 24 hours of receiving the request.\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Drafted and reviewed various commercial agreements, service agreements, lease documents, employment-related documents, and legal correspondence with no material drafting errors requiring rework.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_LEGAL_5\",\"text\":\"Risk Management and Compliance\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Legal 2 (Legal Counsel & PM)\"],\"description\":[\"Reduce potential legal exposure by 10 – 15% annually through proactive measures.\",\"Maintain a regulatory compliance rate of 100%, with no material fines or penalties within the next 12 months.\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Reviewed contracts for compliance with applicable laws and company policies, monitored regulatory obligations, and supported management in maintaining compliance while avoiding legal exposure.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_LEGAL_6\",\"text\":\"Policy and Procedure Updates\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Legal 2 (Legal Counsel & PM)\"],\"description\":[\"Quarterly review of policy document to ensure 100% adherence to relevant laws and regulations.\",\"Draft new company policy documents that are in line with new legislative laws within 5 working days.\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Provided legal guidance on policy implementation and ensured documentation aligned with current legal and regulatory requirements.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_LEGAL_7\",\"text\":\"Reporting and Document Management\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Legal 2 (Legal Counsel & PM)\"],\"description\":[\"Submit an accurate weekly/ activity report before the close of business on Fridays.\",\"Submit an accurate quarterly report before the quarterly review.\",\"Conduct quarterly audit and maintenance of legal documents with a 90% accuracy.\",\"Maintain accurate and up-to-date documents and records, with 100% compliance with document management policies within the next 6 months.\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Maintained organized legal records and contract documentation, submitted periodic reports within required timelines, and improved document management processes. While most reporting obligations were met, there remains room for further enhancement in document archiving and periodic audits.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_LEGAL_8\",\"text\":\"Legal Counsel\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Legal 2 (Legal Counsel & PM)\"],\"description\":[\"Represent the company periodically in legal proceedings/meetings.\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Represented the Company in meetings with external counsel, regulatory agencies while managing dispute resolution matters, provided strategic legal advice to Management, and protected the Company\'s legal interests during negotiations.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_LEGAL_9\",\"text\":\"Property Management\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Legal 2 (Legal Counsel & PM)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure timely renewal of leases, permits, and property documentation.\",\"Conduct regular facility inspections and ensure prompt resolution of maintenance issues.\",\"Maintain company properties in safe and functional condition within approved budgets.\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Managed legal aspects of the Company\'s property portfolio, including tenancy documentation, notices, and regulatory documentation. Ensured timely resolution of legal issues affecting company properties while safeguarding the Company\'s interest.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Demonstrated initiative by identifying legal and operational risks before they escalated, proposing practical solutions, and following through on complex matters until resolution.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Maintained effective communication with Management, colleagues, external solicitors, and business partners. Built positive working relationships that facilitated timely resolution of legal and operational issues\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Maintained a high level of professionalism, reliability, and commitment. Consistently met deadlines, remained responsive to urgent business needs, and adhered to company policies.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Effectively delegated assignments, provided guidance where necessary, and monitored progress to ensure deliverables met required standards.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Continued to develop legal and commercial knowledge through practical exposure to corporate transactions, contract negotiations, compliance, litigation management, and property management. Intend to pursue additional professional development in corporate governance and strategic legal management.\"}]','2026-07-16 15:45:07.000','Continue to improve contract management processes, strengthen regulatory compliance, enhance legal documentation systems, and pursue continuous professional development to support the Company\'s strategic objectives.'),
('REV001EMP031','EMP031','Olubukola Kehinde Adebayo','Finance 4 (Finance Analyst)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','Willing to learn more\n\n','training on advanced excel course and completion of ICAN programme','The employee has shown a commitment to continuous improvement and professional development. HR encourages continued focus on strengthening reporting and data analysis skills while pursuing advanced Excel training and completing the ICAN programme. These development efforts will enhance overall effectiveness and support future career growth.',8.8735,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":\"There is no excuse(s) for delay in deliverables\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"good in deliverables\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":5,\"comments\":\"There has been an improvement in the workflow for Reconciliation on Friday due to the access to Moniepoint Bank Statements. I download the bank statement daily & reconciliate the transaction rather than waiting for Friday morning before have the banks and reconciliate them. This makes my deliverables faster.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"there is an improvement in weekly report delivery time\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"wei