t goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I enrolled in a 3 Months Data Analysis program - this program will help to in the usage of Dashboard, Pivot chart.\\nProfessional certification (ICAN) is in progress.\\nSeeking Professional counsel on reporting with Senior friends in the field.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"she has enrol in data analysis course\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_18\",\"text\":\"Timeliness of Financial Reporting\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Finance 4 (Finance Analyst)\"],\"description\":[\"Submit 100% of monthly management reports within the first 5 working days of the following month\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"managerScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Collating all Bank Statements at the end of the month for Reconciliation and assisting Mr. Rotimi for easy preparation of monthly management report to meet the deadline for submission.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_19\",\"text\":\"Financial Reporting Accuracy\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Finance 4 (Finance Analyst)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain less than 2% reporting adjustment rate after management review\",\"Maintain 98–100% accuracy in financial reporting.\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"managerScore\":60,\"comments\":\"I asked Mr. Rotimi when a transaction is not clear. \\nI met MD also \",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_20\",\"text\":\"Financial Report Reconciliation\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Finance 4 (Finance Analyst)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure 100% reconciliation of financial reports before submission\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"managerScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Yes, 100% Reconciliation\\nRequesting for Bank Statements for the Authorized source, reconciliating & verifying \",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_21\",\"text\":\"Financial Analysis & Profitability Reporting\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Finance 4 (Finance Analyst)\"],\"description\":[\"Prepare quarterly profitability reports for all subsidiaries\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"managerScore\":80,\"comments\":\"Yes, I prepare Quarterly Profitability Reports for all subsidiaries with the support and assistance of Mr. Rotimi\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_22\",\"text\":\"Management Reporting & Dashboard Delivery\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Finance 4 (Finance Analyst)\"],\"description\":[\"Submit all management dashboards and executive reports on schedule\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"managerScore\":90,\"comments\":\"Yes, prepare the pivot table with the transaction and seek the assistance of Mr. Rotimi\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_23\",\"text\":\"Budget Variance Analysis & Monitoring\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"Finance 4 (Finance Analyst)\"],\"description\":[\"Complete all budget variance analyses within agreed timelines\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"managerScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Yes, Budget variance analyses was prepared and submitted on time with the support and assistance of Mr. Rotimi\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\"}]','2026-07-20 12:47:39.000','Become Excellent in Reporting & Analysis\nBetter in Data Analysis\n'),
('REV001EMP032','EMP032','Joyce Anulika Udensi','Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','','she need to undergo e- invoicing  training as per the new tax law and data analyst training.','The employee has demonstrated a willingness to develop professionally. HR encourages her to participate in relevant training, particularly on e-invoicing in line with the new tax regulations and data analysis, to strengthen her technical competence and improve overall job performance.',7.298499999999998,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_7\",\"text\":\"Invoicing Efficiency & Accuracy\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure 100% of invoices are generated within 24–72 hours of service completion or receipt of required documentation\",\"Maintain invoice accuracy rate of 98–100% (minimal errors or rework required)\",\"Ensure 100% of invoices are supported by valid PO/SES and documentation\"],\"selfScore\":70,\"comments\":\"i have ensured all invoices submitted were supported with valid po/ses and orther supporting document been meet to avviod payments delay\",\"managerFeedback\":\"she prepare her invoice promptly\",\"managerScore\":60},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_8\",\"text\":\"Receivables Collection Performance\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)\"],\"description\":[\"Achieve at least 85–95% collection of receivables within agreed credit terms\",\"Maintain accounts receivable aging within approved thresholds (e.g., ≤20% beyond 30 days overdue)\",\"Reduce overdue receivables by at least 10–15% annually\"],\"selfScore\":70,\"comments\":\"i have implemented a tracker which has heled me to reduse overdue of all my receivable\",\"managerFeedback\":\"she maintain her invoice tracker to monitor payment\",\"managerScore\":70},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_9\",\"text\":\"Reporting Timeliness & Accuracy\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)\"],\"description\":[\"Submit weekly and monthly financial and receivables reports 100% on schedule\",\"Maintain 98–100% accuracy in financial reports and receivable schedules\",\"Ensure monthly receivable schedules are completed within the first 5 working days of each month\"],\"selfScore\":70,\"managerFeedback\":\"she has started updating the bus rental report\",\"managerScore\":70},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_10\",\"text\":\"Documentation & Compliance\",\"weight\":7,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain 100% proper filing and documentation of receivables and invoice records\",\"Ensure zero audit queries arising from incomplete or missing documentation\"],\"selfScore\":70,\"comments\":\"i have ensuured all my invoices where backed with valid po/ses and supporting documentbefore submission\",\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\",\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_11\",\"text\":\"Dispute Resolution & Coordination\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)\"],\"description\":[\"Resolve at least 90% of invoice-related discrepancies within 5–7 working days\",\"Ensure 100% timely follow-up on outstanding customer balances\"],\"selfScore\":60,\"comments\":\"i have maintained consistent followup on outstandind customer balances to prevent delays in payment\",\"managerFeedback\":\"she does\",\"managerScore\":70},{\"id\":\"OBJ_FINANCE_ACCOUNTS_12\",\"text\":\"Cash Application & Reconciliation\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"Finance 2 (Acc Receivable)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure 100% accurate posting of received payments into customer accounts\",\"Complete monthly customer account reconciliations with zero unresolved discrepancies beyond one reporting cycle\"],\"selfScore\":70,\"comments\":\"actively posting all accurate receivable payment into the Erp system to avoiod misstatement\