ct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"i have maintained good puntuallity and attendance i took my work serious and ensured tasks were completred with accuracy andintergrity\",\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"she is trying to be good for her role\",\"managerScore\":3},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"i have set personal developement goals to impove my accuracy and efficiency in invoicing and all reavables  i am also commited to learning more and relevant traning to further my skills\",\"managerFeedback\":\"yes\",\"managerScore\":4}]','2026-07-20 12:52:41.000','staff training'),
('REV001EMP033','EMP033','Musa Binta','KHLC 4 (Admin Officer)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','','','Binta has demonstrated strong commitment, reliability, and accountability throughout the review period. HR commends her consistent performance and encourages her to continue strengthening receivables follow-up, improving processes, and developing her leadership and communication skills. Continued growth in these areas will enhance her effectiveness and prepare her for greater responsibilities within the organization.',8.927999999999999,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_SKILLUP_10\",\"text\":\"Stakeholder Relationships\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"KHLC 4 (Admin Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Achieve an average stakeholder relationship rating of 4/5 or higher (>=90%)\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"managerScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_SKILLUP_11\",\"text\":\"Professional Compliance\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"KHLC 4 (Admin Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure a compliance rate of 100% with regards to professionalism from all instructors, supervisor\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"managerScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_SKILLUP_12\",\"text\":\"Client Invoicing\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"KHLC 4 (Admin Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure accurate invoicing of clients on or before 5th week of the term\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"managerScore\":100,\"managerFeedback\":\"Excellent work on client invoicing. You have consistently demonstrated a high level of proactiveness by ensuring invoices are prepared accurately and sent out on time. Your attention to detail, reliability, and commitment to meeting deadlines have contributed significantly to smooth operations and improved cash flow. Keep up this excellent standard and continue looking for ways to enhance the efficiency of the invoicing process.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_SKILLUP_13\",\"text\":\"Receivables Management\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"KHLC 4 (Admin Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure 85% – 90% receivables of all client invoices before 11th week of the term\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"managerScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"You have done a commendable job managing client receivables and following up on outstanding payments. Your consistency and proactive approach have contributed to a strong collection rate, helping the organization maintain healthy cash flow. \\nGoing forward, continue to strengthen your follow-up strategies and build on this performance to achieve even higher collection rates. Well done.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_SKILLUP_14\",\"text\":\"Reporting and Documentation\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"KHLC 4 (Admin Officer)\"],\"description\":[\"Submit accurate quarterly report before end of term\",\"Ensure 100% of documents are filed (physical and digital) in the appropriate systems within 24 hours of receipt, maintaining 98% accuracy.\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"\",\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":5,\"managerFeedback\":\"You consistently demonstrate exceptional initiative by identifying issues early, taking ownership of solutions, and acting without the need for constant supervision. Your persistence in overcoming challenges and your willingness to improve existing processes have had a positive impact on the team\'s efficiency and overall operations. Keep up the excellent work and continue to inspire others through your proactive approach and problem-solving mindset\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":3}]','2026-07-20 12:54:20.000','Binta, you have consistently demonstrated commitment, reliability, and a proactive attitude in carrying out your responsibilities. Your attention to detail, timeliness in client invoicing, and dedication to following up on receivables have contributed positively to the smooth running of our operations. You take ownership of your work and can be relied upon to deliver quality results. Keep building on these strengths while continuing to seek opportunities to improve processes and support the team\'s overall success.\"\\n\\nImprovement Plan\\n1. Strengthen follow-up strategies to improve receivables collection further.\\n2. Continue identifying opportunities to streamline administrative processes.\\n3. Develop your leadership capacity by taking on additional responsibilities and mentoring team members where appropriate.\\n4. Continue enhancing your communication and stakeholder management skills to improve client interactions.'),
('REV001EMP034','EMP034','Banwo Ibisola Yetunde','KHLC 2 (Supervisor)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Manager Reviewed','Successfully supervised daily operations while teaching and maintaining high standards of quality, safety and professionalism. \\nEnsured compliance with organizational  policies, procedures and training requirements. \\nFostered a positive and collaborative work environment by encouraging open communication and accountability. \\nMonitored instructor performance for continuous improvement. \\nI will continue building communication skill conflict resolution skill for more effectiveness. \\nContinue to improve on enhancing effectiveness as a supervisor \\nDevelop expertise in artificial intelligence, data analysis and performance metrics to make  more informed operational decision \\nStrengthen my leadership and people management skills through advanced supervisory and leadership training.','Ibisola, you have been a dependable and committed supervisor who consistently demonstrates professionalism, responsibility, and a genuine willingness to support the team. Your dedication to delivering results and maintaining high standards is evident and appreciated. As you continue to grow in your role, I encourage you to intentionally develop your leadership presence and influence, particularly in guiding and motivating our instructors. Great leaders do more than coordinate tasks; they inspire confidence, coach others to perform at their best, and create an environment where people are empowered to succeed. I believe you have the potential to become that kind of leader. Be more intentional about mentoring your instructors, providing constructive feedback, and leading with confidence. \\n\\nI look forward to seeing you grow into an even stronger leader who not only achieves results but also develops people along the way.',NULL,8.4,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"You have shown commendable leadership by taking ownership of your responsibilities and following through on your commitments. Your willingness to support team members and lead by example has contributed positively to the team\'s success. As you continue to grow, focus on taking even greater initiative, anticipating challenges before they arise, and inspiring others to consistently deliver their best.\\\"\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"You have shown the ability to handle challenges and complete your responsibilities, but there is room to become more proactive and self-driven. Focus on anticipating issues, taking ownership of solutions, and consistently looking for ways to improve existing processes. Developing these habits will strengthen your contribution to the team and position you for greater leadership opportunities.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":3,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"You are making a conscious effort to communicate and work well with others, and that progress is appreciated. To strengthen your effectiveness, focus on communicating more confidently and proactively, listening actively to understand different perspectives, and nurturing stronger professional relationships. Continued improvement in these areas will have a positive impact on both your individual and team performance.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":5,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"Your commitment to your work is outstanding. You consistently demonstrate reliability, maintain excellent attendance and punctuality, and conduct yourself with a high level of professionalism. Your strong work ethic and adherence to company values make you a dependable team member and a positive role model for your colleagues. Keep up the excellent standard.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_2_1\",\"text\":\"Program Execution \\u0026 Delivery\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 2 (Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure timely execution of all learning programmes within the term by delivering \\u003e=95% of programs\"],\"selfScore\":null,\"managerScore\":null,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_2_2\",\"text\":\"Participant Engagement \\u0026 Attendance\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 2 (Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure at least 90% participation (internal and external teams) in the execution of each program\"],\"selfScore\":null,\"managerScore\":null,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_2_3\",\"text\":\"Professional Development\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 2 (Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Complete at least 2 professional courses annually to improve skills and knowledge relevant to program coordination.\"],\"selfScore\":null,\"managerScore\":null,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_2_4\",\"text\":\"Instructor Management \\u0026 Quality Assurance\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 2 (Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"90% participant satisfaction ratings in post-session feedback on subject matter expertise\",\"95% adherence to class schedules without significant delays or cancellations\",\"Zero incidents of reported unprofessional conduct during the term\",\"Problem solving/ Thinking outside the box during execution of programs\"],\"selfScore\":null,\"managerScore\":null,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_2_5\",\"text\":\"Team Performance Feedback\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 2 (Supervisor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure 100% of team members receive formal performance feedback at least once per quarter\"],\"selfScore\":null,\"managerScore\":null,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null}]','2026-07-15 14:40:32.000','\\n\\nImprovement Plan\\n1. Develop stronger leadership presence by confidently guiding and influencing instructors.\\n2. Conduct regular coaching and feedback sessions to support instructor performance and growth.\\n3. Take greater initiative in resolving operational challenges with minimal supervision.\\n4. Strengthen communication by setting clear expectations and following up consistently.\\n5. Complete at least one leadership development activity and apply the learnings in day-to-day supervision.'),
('REV001EMP035','EMP035','Iniobong Christiana Okokon','SU 1 (Program Coordinator)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Manager Reviewed','During the first half of the year, I have demonstrated strong commitment and ownership in coordinating SkillUp Academy’s programs and daily operations. I successfully supported the delivery and completion of training programs by coordinating instructors, managing learner communication, monitoring progress, facilitating project submissions and defenses, and ensuring smooth cohort activities. I also contributed to the planning and ongoing execution of the Summer Tech Camp through registration coordination, parent engagement, marketing collaboration, and operational preparation.\\n\\nI have continued to develop my coordination, communication, and leadership skills by taking initiative, managing responsibilities effectively, and working collaboratively with team members and management. Moving forward, I remain committed to improving processes, strengthening learner experiences, and contributing to the continued growth and success of SkillUp Academy.','You have demonstrated strong commitment to the day-to-day operations of SkillUp Academy and have contributed significantly to ensuring that training programs run smoothly. Your organization, coordination, and dedication are appreciated and have had a positive impact on the Academy\'s operations. As you continue to grow in your role, I encourage you to become more proactive in areas that require strategic ownership, particularly learner feedback, performance reporting, and partnership development. Taking initiative in these areas will strengthen decision-making, improve the learner experience, and contribute to the long-term growth of SkillUp Academy. I am confident that with greater consistency and intentionality, you can make an even greater impact.\n\nImprovement Plan>\n1. Submit learner performance and end-of-cohort reports promptly without requiring follow-up.\n2. Conduct regular learner feedback sessions and use insights to improve program delivery.\n3. Develop and execute a partnership engagement plan, targeting potential industry partners each month.\n4. Continue strengthening operational excellence while taking greater ownership of strategic responsibilities.',NULL,7.286,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_SU_SKILLUP_1\",\"text\":\"Program Planning & Coordination\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"SU 1 (Program Coordinator)\"],\"description\":[\"Develop and implement training schedules and skill-up calendars for various cohorts, as well as courses offered at the Academy.\",\"Teach and coordinate soft and technical skills programs in line with Academy objectives.\",\"Manage enrollment and payment processes and class rosters and ensure learners have access to relevant resources.\",\"Organize in-person and virtual training sessions to accommodate learners\' different demands.\",\"Assist in recruiting and onboarding new instructors to meet program demands.\",\"Manage daily operations of Skill-up Academy, including scheduling, resource allocation, and staff management.\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"I coordinated the successful delivery of SkillUp Academy\'s training programs by developing training schedules, managing student registrations and class rosters, coordinating instructors, and ensuring learners had access to the required resources. I also led the planning and operational coordination for the 2026 Summer Tech Camp, facilitated communication between instructors and learners, and managed day-to-day academy activities to ensure programs were delivered efficiently and aligned with the Academy\'s objectives.\",\"managerScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"You have demonstrated exceptional commitment in coordinating and managing the daily operations of SkillUp Academy. Your ability to effectively plan training schedules, coordinate programs, manage learner enrollment, and ensure the smooth delivery of both in-person and virtual sessions has been commendable. You consistently keep operations organized, respond proactively to challenges, and ensure that learners and instructors have the support they need. Your dedication and attention to detail have played a significant role in the Academy\'s success. Keep up the excellent work and continue driving operational excellence\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_SU_SKILLUP_2\",\"text\":\"Instructor & Learner Engagement\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"SU 1 (Program Coordinator)\"],\"description\":[\"Work closely with instructors to ensure smooth course delivery and learning experiences.\",\"Serves as a point of contact for learners, addressing any issues related to course content, schedules, or resources.\",\"Conduct regular feedback sessions with instructors and learners to monitor progress and areas of improvement.\",\"Motivate learners by tracking their progress and celebrating achievements.\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"Throughout the first half of the year, I worked closely with instructors to ensure the smooth delivery of classes and served as the primary point of contact for learners, promptly addressing enquiries related to schedules, resources, and course activities. I coordinated learner feedback, monitored student progress, and successfully facilitated the completion of a cohort, including Cisco course completions, project defense presentations, and graduation activities, while recognizing learners\' achievements to encourage engagement and course completion.\",\"managerScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"You have built positive working relationships with instructors and have contributed to ensuring the smooth delivery of training programs. You are responsive in supporting learners and helping to resolve operational concerns. As you continue to grow, I encourage you to be more intentional and consistent in gathering and providing feedback, particularly with learners. Regular check-ins, progress updates, and timely follow-ups will strengthen learner engagement, improve the overall learning experience, and help us identify areas for continuous improvement.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_SU_SKILLUP_3\",\"text\":\"Resource Management\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"SU 1 (Program Coordinator)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure all training materials, equipment, and resources are available during training sessions.\",\"Collaborate with instructors to update and improve course materials as needed.\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"I ensured that the required training materials and learning resources were available to support the effective delivery of training sessions. I also worked closely with instructors to review and update course content, coordinate project requirements, and prepare resources for new programs, including the Summer Tech Camp, to ensure learners had a seamless learning experience.\",\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_SU_SKILLUP_4\",\"text\":\"Performance Tracking & Reporting\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"SU 1 (Program Coordinator)\"],\"description\":[\"Analyze learner performance data and generate reports to measure the effectiveness of the training programs.\",\"Identify trends and suggest improvements to enhance the learning experience and overall program effectiveness.\",\"Report key performance metrics and end-of-cohort activities to the Program Coordinator at the end of every cohort training.\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"I monitored learner attendance, engagement, and overall performance throughout the training programs and provided regular updates to support informed decision-making. At the completion of the cohort, I coordinated project presentations, tracked course completion outcomes, compiled end-of-cohort reports and key performance metrics, and shared recommendations to improve learner engagement, program delivery, and future training activities.\",\"managerScore\":70,\"managerFeedback\":\"You have the ability to gather and track learner performance data; however, there is a need for greater consistency and proactivity in reporting. Performance reports and end-of-cohort summaries should be submitted without the need for follow-up or reminders. Timely reporting is essential for evaluating program effectiveness, making informed decisions, and planning future cohorts. Going forward, focus on establishing a routine for analyzing learner outcomes, identifying key trends, and submitting comprehensive reports promptly after each cohort.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_SU_SKILLUP_5\",\"text\":\"Partnership Development\",\"weight\":8,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"SU 1 (Program Coordinator)\"],\"description\":[\"Establish partnerships with industry professionals, organizations, and companies to provide learners with opportunities for internships, job placements, and real-world experience.\"],\"selfScore\":10,\"comments\":\"Initial plans for establishing industry partnerships have been in progress as part of the Academy\'s long-term strategy. While this objective was not a primary focus during the review period, it will become a key area of focus in the coming months as we work towards building collaborations that provide learners with internship, mentorship, job placement, and real-world learning opportunities.\",\"managerScore\":10,\"managerFeedback\":\"This is an area that requires significant improvement. The expected partnerships with industry professionals and organizations were not established during the review period, limiting opportunities for learner exposure, internships, and career development. \\nGoing forward, there should be a more structured and proactive approach to identifying potential partners, initiating conversations, and following through to secure meaningful collaborations. \\nBuilding strategic partnerships should become a key priority in the next review cycle.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I consistently took ownership of assigned responsibilities by coordinating tasks, assigning responsibilities where necessary, and providing guidance to team members to ensure activities were completed effectively. I maintained accountability for key deliverables by following up on assigned tasks, ensuring deadlines were met, and supporting the successful execution of training programs, learner projects, and other Academy initiatives.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I consistently demonstrated initiative by proactively driving the ongoing Summer Tech Camp registration and enrollment process through timely follow-ups with prospective parents, addressing enquiries, resolving concerns, and encouraging registrations. I also took the initiative to resolve operational challenges as they arose, coordinated with team members to keep activities on track, and continuously identified opportunities to improve workflows and communication across Academy programs.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I maintained clear and professional communication with team members, learners, and other stakeholders while remaining receptive to feedback and implementing suggestions to improve my work. I collaborated closely with the marketing team on Summer Tech Camp promotional activities and worked with line managers on program planning and coordination, fostering positive working relationships that supported the successful execution of Academy initiatives.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I consistently demonstrated reliability and commitment by meeting deadlines, being readily available to support Academy activities, and ensuring assigned responsibilities were completed to a high standard. I maintained a professional work ethic through punctuality, adherence to organizational policies and procedures, and a strong sense of responsibility in carrying out my duties.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I coordinated and assigned responsibilities to instructors and team members, ensuring lectures, project submissions, and other program deliverables were completed according to schedule. Through regular follow-ups, performance monitoring, and constructive feedback, I helped maintain accountability, supported timely execution of tasks, and contributed to the successful delivery of Academy programs.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I intentionally sought opportunities to improve my effectiveness by welcoming feedback from my supervisors and implementing suggestions to enhance my coordination, communication, and planning skills. I also invested in my personal and professional growth by participating in relevant learning opportunities that have strengthened my ability to contribute more effectively to the Academy\'s objectives.\",\"managerScore\":4}]','2026-07-16 11:42:16.000','For the next review cycle, I aim to contribute to the continued growth and improvement of SkillUp Academy by increasing student enrollment, improving learner engagement, and enhancing student satisfaction through a more structured feedback and support system. I will focus on ensuring the delivery of high-quality training programs by strengthening instructor coordination, monitoring course delivery, and supporting effective learning outcomes. I also plan to contribute to the successful execution of the Summer Tech Camp and upcoming cohorts, improve operational processes, and support the development of strategic partnerships with industry professionals and organizations to create more opportunities and real-world experiences for our learners.'),
('REV001EMP036','EMP036','Nwantu Faith Titus','KHLC 1 (Instructor)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Manager Reviewed','','You have done an excellent job, and your hard work is truly commendable. Keep striving for excellence because your best today can become your starting point for an even greater achievement tomorrow. I believe in your potential, and I\'m confident you can do even better than your best. Keep learning, keep improving, and never stop aiming higher.',NULL,7.591777777777777,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":3,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":3,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":3,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"You need to learn to communicate better \"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":3,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_1\",\"text\":\"Resource Adherence & Lesson Plans\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure instructors use the resources (Lesson plan) 100% of the time during sessions\"],\"selfScore\":50,\"managerScore\":null,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"No lesson plan \"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_2\",\"text\":\"Dress Code & Professional compliance\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure a compliance rate of 100% with the organization\'s professional dress code for all training sessions\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"managerScore\":90,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_3\",\"text\":\"Stakeholder Relationships\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Achieve an average stakeholder relationship rating of 4/5 or higher\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"managerScore\":70,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_4\",\"text\":\"Practical Training Ratio\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure instructors train students using 80% practical session, 20% theory\"],\"selfScore\":50,\"managerScore\":40,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":\"You need to do more practical with your pupils so they really go home excited to learn new things \"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_5\",\"text\":\"Instructor Clarity & Engagement Feedback\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain an average feedback score of 4.5/5 for clarity of instruction and session engagement on post- training evaluations each term.\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"managerScore\":70,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_6\",\"text\":\"Professional Development\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Complete at least 2 professional courses annually to improve skills and knowledge relevant to program coordination.\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"managerScore\":50,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_7\",\"text\":\"Daily Activity & Attendance Reporting\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"catego