('REV001EMP041','EMP041','Okunuga Seyi Samuel','KHLC 1 (Instructor)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Manager Reviewed','I take my work seriously and am fully committed to delivering high quality results. I am proactive, dependable, and willing to do whatever is necessary to ensure tasks are completed accurately and on time. I stay focused on my responsibilities, manage my time effectively, and consistently follow through on commitments. Whether working independently or as part of a team, I strive to overcome challenges, meet deadlines, and achieve the best possible outcomes.','The Instructor demonstrates professionalism, accountability, and a strong commitment to learner development. Lesson delivery has been effective and aligned to curriculum standards. The improvement plan to build ICT, Robotics skills and increase student engagement is well noted and supported.  \\nI am confident that with continued focus, the Instructor will make even greater impact on company goals next term.\\n',NULL,8.5,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"w