('REV001EMP042','EMP042','Adeyemi Halimat Adedoyin','KHLC 1 (Instructor)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Manager Reviewed','I have carried out my expected service delivery duly and diligently.','Adedoyin has demonstrated exceptional commitment, professionalism, and technical competence throughout the year and delivered with confidence, while practical demonstrations enabled learners to understand and apply ICT effectively.\nThe instructor consistently integrated modern digital tools into classroom activities, encouraged active participation, and maintained a positive learning environment. Their dedication, innovation, and willingness to support both learners and colleagues have contributed greatly to the success of the programme.\nAreas for Improvement\nContinue exploring emerging technologies such as Artificial Intelligence, Cloud Computing, and Cybersecurity to further enrich classroom instruction.\nIncrease the use of project-based and collaborative learning activities to strengthen students\' practical problem-solving skills.\nParticipate regularly in professional development programmes, workshops, and ICT certifications to stay current with industry trends.\nContinue developing more interactive digital learning resources to enhance student engagement and learning outcomes.',NULL,9.214444444444442,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":5,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve iss