('REV001EMP047','EMP047','Deborah Dennis','KHLC 1 (Instructor)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Manager Reviewed','','Deborah, you are doing well, and I commend your efforts. However, I believe you have the potential to do even better. Remember, every step you take toward improving yourself is an investment in your future.\nMake it a habit to develop yourself every day by learning new skills, seeking knowledge, and giving your best in all you do. Consistent growth and determination will open doors to greater opportunities and help you achieve even greater heights. Keep pushing yourself—you have what it takes to excel.',NULL,5.276,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":3,\"managerScore\":2,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":3,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":3,\"managerScore\":3,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"manager