('REV001EMP053','EMP053','Elizabeth Oderinde','KHLC 1 (Instructor)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Manager Reviewed','I successfully delivered engaging coding lessons to primary and secondary school students, using practical, project-based learning to improve programming, problem-solving, and computational thinking skills. I maintained a positive learning environment, monitored students\' progress, and continuously enhanced my teaching through self-development.','Well done! You have done an excellent job, and I sincerely appreciate your dedication, commitment, and valuable contributions. Your efforts have not gone unnoticed, and I commend you for the positive impact you continue to make. Keep up the good work and never stop striving for excellence.\n\nAs you continue to grow, I encourage you to pay closer attention to a few important areas that will further enhance your performance. Please make it a priority to attend every training session whenever it is scheduled. These trainings are organized to equip you with new knowledge, improve your skills, and help you remain effective and up to date in your responsibilities. Likewise, your active participation in our online meetings is very important, as they provide essential information, guidance, and opportunities to learn, contribute, and stay connected with the team.\n\nIn addition, cultivate the habit of arriving early for all meetings, trainings, and assigned activities. Punctuality reflects discipline, professionalism, responsibility, and respect for other people\'s time. Being early gives you enough time to settle in, prepare adequately, and participate fully from the beginning. It also sets a positive example for others to follow.\n\nFinally, please make it a habit to submit your daily reports consistently, accompanied by clear pictures or videos of your activities. These reports are essential for monitoring progress, documenting achievements, and ensuring proper accountability. Timely and accurate reporting demonstrates commitment, responsibility, and attention to detail.\n\nI believe you have the ability and potential to achieve even greater success. Stay focused, remain teachable, embrace every opportunity to learn, and continue giving your very best. With consistency, punctuality, active participation, and a commitment to continuous improvement, you will keep growing professionally and reach even greater heights. Keep up the excellent work—I am confident that your best is still ahead of you.',NULL,6.855999999999998,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"