feedback and coaching, and supported team members in achieving their targets and improving performance.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Set clear personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives, actively sought feedback to improve performance, and completed relevant training courses to enhance professional knowledge, teaching effectiveness, and overall productivity.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_1\",\"text\":\"Resource Adherence & Lesson Plans\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure instructors use the resources (Lesson plan) 100% of the time during sessions\"],\"selfScore\":null,\"managerScore\":80,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_2\",\"text\":\"Dress Code & Professional compliance\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure a compliance rate of 100% with the organization\'s professional dress code for all training sessions\"],\"selfScore\":null,\"managerScore\":80,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_3\",\"text\":\"Stakeholder Relationships\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Achieve an average stakeholder relationship rating of 4/5 or higher\"],\"selfScore\":null,\"manage