gerScore\":90,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_9\",\"text\":\"Profile Updates\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Submit accurate profile form for the term on the 5th – 6th week\"],\"selfScore\":null,\"managerScore\":80,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_10\",\"text\":\"Punctuality & Arrival Rate\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Achieve a 95% on-time arrival rate for all scheduled classes\"],\"selfScore\":null,\"managerScore\":90,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null}]','2026-07-16 14:52:08.000','I plan to continue improving my teaching and leadership skills by attending relevant training, enhancing lesson delivery techniques, strengthening communication and teamwork, using learner feedback to improve classroom performance, and consistently achieving or exceeding all assigned KPIs. I will also continue to adopt new teaching methods and educational technologies to improve learning outcomes.'),
('REV001EMP055','EMP055','Folarin Hassanah Abisola','KHLC 1 (Instructor)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Manager Reviewed','This term has been productive. I successfully delivered Pictoblox and HTML training with a strong focus on practical learning, resulting in improved student skills and project completion. I maintained professionalism through punctuality, proper work ethics, timely reporting, and effective communication with students and colleagues. I remain committed to self-development and contributing to NETS goals. I appreciate the support and opportunity to grow as an ICT Instructor.','',NULL,8.311,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":3,\"comments\":\"I demonstrated responsibility and ownership in my role as ICT Instructor. I ensured all Pictoblox and HTML classes ran smoothly, met targets, and aligned with NETS objectives. I led by example in reporting, and student mentorship.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I demonstrated initiative by proactively identifying student learning gaps in Pictoblox and HTML classes and creating extra practice exercises without waiting for instructions. I persisted in overcoming challenges like limited lab time by organizing after-class project sessions. I also continuously improved workflows by introducing step-by-step project guides that made learning more engaging and effective for students.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I communicated instructions clearly and professionally to students, colleagues, and management. I provided timely feedback, shared progress updates, and ensured everyone understood tasks and expectations.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":3,\"comments\":\"I maintained high reliability and commitment to my role as ICT Instructor. I achieved over 90% punctuality and attendance for all classes and meetings. I adhered strictly to NETS dress code and corporate code of conduct, and submitted all daily and term reports on time.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":null,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":null,\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"departments\":null,\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":null,\"managerScore\":4,\"comments\":\"I set personal development goals aligned with NETS objectives this term. I completed online trainings to improve my skills in Pictoblox, and HTML. I also actively sought feedback from colleagues and management to improve my teaching delivery and classroom management.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_1\",\"text\":\"Resource Adherence & Lesson Plans\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure instructors use the resources (Lesson plan) 100% of the time during sessions\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"managerScore\":90,\"comments\":\"I prepared and used lesson plans 100% of the time during all teaching sessions. For Pictoblox and HTML classes, I developed structured lesson notes, practical exercises, and project guides. All resources were aligned with the curriculum and helped students achieve their learning objectives effectively..\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_2\",\"text\":\"Dress Code & Professional compliance\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure a compliance rate of 100% with the organization\'s professional dress code for all training sessions\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"managerScore\":90,\"comments\":\"I maintained a professional and neat appearance at all times in line with NETS corporate dress code policy. I ensured my dressing reflected the values of the organization and set a good example for students during classes and official programs.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_3\",\"text\":\"Stakeholder Relationships\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Achieve an average stakeholder relationship rating of 4/5 or higher\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"managerScore\":90,\"comments\":\"I maintained strong stakeholder relationships and represented NETS professionally at all times. I collaborated effectively with team members and management to achieve program goals and ensure smooth delivery of ICT training.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_4\",\"text\":\"Practical Training Ratio\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure instructors train students using 80% practical session, 20% theory\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"managerScore\":80,\"comments\":\"I maintained the 80% practical and 20% theory training ratio in all Pictoblox and HTML classes. Students were actively involved in hands-on coding, project building, and debugging. This approach improved skill acquisition and ensured students could apply what they learned independently.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_5\",\"text\":\"Instructor Clarity & Engagement Feedback\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Maintain an average feedback score of 4.5/5 for clarity of instruction and session engagement on post- training evaluations each term.\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"managerScore\":80,\"comments\":\"I ensured clarity of instruction and high student engagement in all sessions. I used simple explanations, live demonstrations, and interactive activities. Based on student feedback and class participation, I maintained a high level of clarity and engagement, with students completing projects confidently.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_6\",\"text\":\"Professional Development\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Complete at least 2 professional courses annually to improve skills and knowledge relevant to program coordination.\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"managerScore\":80,\"comments\":\"I committed to professional growth this term by engaging in self-learning and skill improvement relevant to ICT training. I completed courses and trainings to improve my knowledge of Pictoblox, and HTML. This helped me deliver updated content and better support students and program coordination.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_7\",\"text\":\"Daily Activity & Attendance Reporting\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Submit accurate daily reports(/attendance) before close of business\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"managerScore\":80,\"comments\":\"I submitted accurate daily reports and attendance records before the close of business each day. This ensured proper documentation of student activities and training progress, and supported effective monitoring and accountability for the program.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_8\",\"text\":\"Term Reporting\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Submit accurate report for the term on the 12th week of the term\"],\"selfScore\":null,\"managerScore\":80,\"comments\":\"I submitted an accurate term report on the 12th week of the term as required. The report contained details of student performance, challenges, achievements, and recommendations for Pictoblox and HTML classes. This ensured proper documentation and informed decision-making for the program.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_9\",\"text\":\"Profile Updates\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Submit accurate profile form for the term on the 5th – 6th week\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"managerScore\":80,\"comments\":\"I submitted my accurate profile update form between the 5th and 6th week of the term. All required information about my classes, student data, and activities was provided on time to support record keeping and program coordination.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"OBJ_KHLC_1_10\",\"text\":\"Punctuality & Arrival Rate\",\"weight\":4,\"type\":\"objective\",\"expectedLevel\":null,\"category\":null,\"departments\":[\"KHLC 1 (Instructor)\"],\"description\":[\"Achieve a 95% on-time arrival rate for all scheduled classes\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"managerScore\":90,\"comments\":\"I maintained a  level of punctuality this term with over 90% on-time arrival for all scheduled classes. I arrived early to prepare the lab, set up equipment, and ensure learning started promptly. This promoted discipline and maximized instructional time.\",\"evidence\":null,\"managerFeedback\":null}]','2026-07-16 14:54:56.000','For the next review cycle, my goals are:\n1.  Complete 2 professional development courses in coding and AI tools to enhance training delivery.\n2.  Introduce more advanced practical projects to improve student creativity and problem-solving.\n3.  Strengthen collaboration with other instructors to integrate ICT into more school activities and programs.'),
('REV001HR001','HR001','Egba Stella Adutomivie','HR 1 (HR Executive 1)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Submitted','Through out the review period, I consistently demonstrated commitment, professionalism and accountability in carrying out my tasks. \\nI completed assigned tasks,  maintained strong work ethic, punctuality an attendance, built positive working relationships, participated in learning opportunities,  demonstrated initiatives in resolving work place issues and provided support and guidance to team members where necessary.',NULL,NULL,2.8349999999999995,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_7\",\"text\":\"Employee Grievance Resolution\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 1 (HR Executive 1)\"],\"description\":[\"Resolve 90% of employee grievances within 5 working days within the next 6 months\",\"Achieve a conflict resolution rate of 90% or better, with no unresolved conflicts lasting more than 30 days within the next 12 months\",\"Performance Management\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"I was able to resolve all instructors related conflicts within 3 working days.\\nLiaised with supervisors to give query to instructors  when necessary. \\nResolved driver\'s complaints timely (especially with salaries, HMO, Pension and Trip allowance)\\nLiaised with site reps to resolve drivers complaints across all regions.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_8\",\"text\":\"Performance Review Compliance\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 1 (HR Executive 1)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensuring 100% compliance regarding the quarterly performance review\",\"Execution of the result of the bi-annual performance appraisal on or before the 2nd week of the next half-year\",\"Recruitment and Retention\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"comments\":\"Pushed instructors for 100% compliance.\\nCarried out disciplinary actions when a 100 % compliance was not met.\\n90% recruitment met for both drivers and instructors.\\n100% retention met for instructors.\\nOnboarding and integration of new employees.\\n\\n\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_9\",\"text\":\"Staff Turnover Reduction\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 1 (HR Executive 1)\"],\"description\":[\"Reduce the overall employee turnover rate to 10% or less within the next 12 months\",\"Time-to-Hire: Reduce average time (2months) taken to fill open positions within the next 12months\",\"Onboarding: Within one week of resumption\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"Worked with management to improve employee experience through workplace improvement\\nOnboarding and integration of new employees.\\n\\n\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_10\",\"text\":\"Confirmation Letter Distribution\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 1 (HR Executive 1)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure employees receive confirmation letters by the first week of the 7th month\",\"Payroll Management and Statutory Compliance\",\"Achieve a payroll accuracy rate of 99.5% or better, with no more than 0.5% errors in payroll processing within the next 6 months\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Confirmation process was carried out and confirmation letters were sent out as at when due.\\nPayroll is sent for approval on or before 24th of every month with marginal error.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_11\",\"text\":\"Statutory Payments & Payroll Processing\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 1 (HR Executive 1)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure a monthly schedule of all (Pension, Tax, NSITF, etc.) statutory payments on or before the last day of every month\",\"Ensure submission of payroll approval for salaries on the 22nd of the month\",\"Ensure payment of monthly salaries on the 26th of the month for all staff and on the 24th for NBC\"],\"comments\":\"Statutory payment schedule for each month is prepared on time and sent to the finance department for payments.\\nPayroll schedule for each month is prepared and submitted for approval on or before the 22nd of every month.\\nNBC payroll is set and ready before the 24th  of every month.\",\"selfScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_12\",\"text\":\"Employee Engagement & Satisfaction\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 1 (HR Executive 1)\"],\"description\":[\"Employee Engagement and Satisfaction\",\"Bi-annual Execution of Employee Satisfaction Survey – Timeline 3weeks\",\"Ensure 75% participation rate in the surveys\"],\"comments\":\"Team bonding activities are done every quarter.\\nTrainings are scheduled monthly.\\nEmployees are encouraged to participate in the surveys.\\nWeekly book reviews.\\nTownhall meeting.\\n\\n\",\"selfScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_13\",\"text\":\"Employee Engagement & Satisfaction\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 1 (HR Executive 1)\"],\"description\":[\"Achieve a 75% engagement score by the end of the year\",\"Exit Management\",\"Average Time-to-Exit: Average time taken to complete the exit process\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Employees surveys and feedback sessions.\\nConducted exit interviews.\\nEnsured timely clearance and handover.\\nPrepared and processed exit documentation within required timeline.\\n\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_14\",\"text\":\"Exit Process Completion Rate\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 1 (HR Executive 1)\"],\"description\":[\"Exit Process Completion Rate: Percentage of exit processes completed within a specified timeframe\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"All exit was carried out with the right process.\\nEnsure company\'s properties were retrieved.\\nAll forms were filled and signed.\\nAll exist process was documented.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"comments\":\"Tasks are completed on time.\\nCommunicate feedback.\\nPromote teamwork, collaboration and open communication.\\nAccepted responsibility for decisions and outcomes.\\nMaintained records.\\n\\n\",\"selfScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":4,\"comments\":\"Addressed employee concern promptly and facilitated discussions to reach a resolution.\\nEscalating issues only when necessary after trying to resolve it.\\nMet deadlines.\\nShared ideas for improving team productivity.\\n\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Communicate feedback.\\nReporting to and taking directions from my line manager.\\nDemonstrating teamwork and cooperation.\\nFostering good relationships with colleagues.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Consistently completed assigned tasks.\\nDemonstrated accountability by taking responsibility and following through commitments.\\nVolunteered to support additional responsibilities when team objectives are to be met.\\nMaintained high attendance records with minimal unplanned absences.  \\nAdhered to work schedules and met deadlines reliably.\\nConsistently complied with the organization\'s policies.\\nMaintained confidentiality of sensitive company and employee information.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"KPI\'s were given to all team members.\\nJob descriptions were given to team members and a signed copy retrieved from them.\\nConducted one on one meetings to provide constructive feedback.\\nIdentified performance gaps and developed action plans.\\nEncouraged open communications and offering practical solutions and support.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"comments\":\"Strengthened communication and interpersonal skills through continuous learning.\\nSet personal development goals.\\nSeek honest and direct feedback from my line manager.\\nUpdate knowledge of industry trend regularly. \",\"selfScore\":5}]','2026-07-15 14:31:34.000','Completing my CIPM certification.'),
('REV001HR002','HR002','Kalu Gift Kelechi','HR 3 (Head of HR)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','HR Approved','This review period has been a great learning experience. I remained committed to supporting the organization by improving HR processes, supporting employees, and delivering on my responsibilities. I am open to feedback and always looking for ways to learn, grow, and add more value to the organization. In the next review period, I look forward to continuing to improve our HR processes to better support employees and the business.','General overrall evaluation is good performance for the 1st 6 months of 2026. You and your team have been able to stabilize HR despite all the challenges we had in 2026. We need consolidate gains and wins you have add  for the 1st 6months and build on them. Strengthen the performance management process. Create campaigns around team engagement and key policies implementation. implement good welfare initiatives and programs','',7.737,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_23\",\"text\":\"Employee Engagement\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 3 (Head of HR)\"],\"description\":[\"Increase employee engagement score by 10% as measured by an annual employee satisfaction survey\",\"Reduce employee turnover rate by 5% year-over-year\",\"Increase the number of employees receiving formal recognition for their contributions by 20%.\"],\"comments\":\"I contributed to improving employee engagement by working closely with management and the team in planning employee-focused initiatives, including providing a conducive office environment, appreciation activities, engagements, and team-bonding events. I also ensured timely communication on HR matters, supported employee welfare, and provided guidance on workplace concerns to improve the overall employee experience. These efforts positively impacted employee morale and engagement throughout the review period.\",\"selfScore\":80,\"managerScore\":70,\"managerFeedback\":\"HR shld create more engagement initiatives for staff\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_24\",\"text\":\"Learning and Manpower Development\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 3 (Head of HR)\"],\"description\":[\"Training Completion Rate: Achieve a 95% employee participation rate in mandatory training programs (e.g., safety, compliance)\",\"Employee Skill Improvement: Measured through assessments before and after training\",\"Achieve a 95% utilization rate of the allocated L&D budget\",\"%tage number of quarterly trainings for external clients (in collaboration with LASTMA, FRSC) etc executed\"],\"selfScore\":70,\"comments\":\"So far, we have organized and coordinated departmental trainings, book reviews, and other learning sessions to support employee development. We also started work on a training platform that will help track employees\' learning and progress. In the next review period, we plan to carry out training needs assessments for all employees and develop structured training plans based on their individual development needs.\",\"managerScore\":60,\"managerFeedback\":\"Management Team L&D objectives shld be priorized\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_25\",\"text\":\"Strategic Workforce Management\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 3 (Head of HR)\"],\"description\":[\"Workforce Planning Accuracy: Percentage accuracy of forecasting workforce needs across the group.\",\"Succession Planning Coverage: Percentage of key roles with identified successors ready within a set timeframe.\"],\"comments\":\"I supported workforce planning by monitoring staffing needs and coordinating recruitment to fill critical roles across the group. We also began identifying key positions for succession planning, with plans to develop a more structured succession framework in the next review period.\",\"selfScore\":80,\"managerScore\":70},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_26\",\"text\":\"Oversee Performance Management Process\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 3 (Head of HR)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensuring 100% compliance regarding quarterly performance review\",\"Execution of result of bi-annual performance appraisal on or before the 2nd week of the next half year\"],\"comments\":\"I coordinated the first quarter and half-year performance review process, ensuring employees and managers completed their appraisals within the set timelines. Followed up on compliance, provided support where needed, and worked to ensure appraisal outcomes were communicated. \\nWe are also implementing an ERP system that will make performance management more structured and also kick-start a monthly manager-employee check-ins to provide regular feedback, monitor progress, and support continuous performance improvement.\",\"selfScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"Lets keep up with the process and the plans for effective performance mgt process. we are on track. lets close it sucessfully\",\"managerScore\":80},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_27\",\"text\":\"Recruitment and Retention at the Group Level\",\"weight\":6,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 3 (Head of HR)\"],\"description\":[\"Group-Wide Turnover Rate: Aggregate employee turnover across all business units\",\"Diversity and Inclusion Metrics: Percentage representation of diverse groups in leadership and across the organization.\"],\"selfScore\":80,\"comments\":\"I supported recruitment by filling open positions and working with management to hire the right people. We also ensured all candidates were given a fair opportunity during the recruitment process and continued efforts to retain employees.\",\"managerScore\":80,\"managerFeedback\":\"satisfactory performance\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_28\",\"text\":\"Health, Safety, and Well-Being\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 3 (Head of HR)\"],\"description\":[\"Group Incident Reduction Rate: Reduction in workplace incidents across the group by 0% - 5%\",\"Employee Well-Being Participation: Percentage of employees engaging in group-wide wellness programs\",\"Health and Safety Audit Compliance: Percentage of units compliant with health and safety regulations.\"],\"comments\":\"Collaborated with the HSE Officer to organize regular HSE training for staff and support workplace safety and employee well-being.\",\"selfScore\":90,\"managerFeedback\":\"satisfactory\",\"managerScore\":70},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_29\",\"text\":\"HR Operational Efficiency\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 3 (Head of HR)\"],\"description\":[\"HR Budget Utilization: Percentage of the HR budget effectively used.\",\"Policy Update Frequency: Ensuring policies are updated on schedule to match industry standards and legal requirements.\"],\"comments\":\"I managed the HR budget responsibly and ensured resources were used effectively. Also reviewed and updated HR policies and procedures to keep them relevant and aligned with company needs and current labour regulations.\",\"selfScore\":80,\"managerScore\":60,\"managerFeedback\":\"2027 budget must influence every decisions made. this is a total company focus for 2027\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"Led with an open and supportive leadership style by building trust within the team, encouraging collaboration, and maintaining open communication. Took ownership of responsibilities, supported team members, and remained accountable for delivering results while leading by example.\",\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"comments\":\"Took initiative by identifying issues early and resolving them without waiting for instructions. Stayed persistent when faced with challenges, followed through on tasks to completion, and continuously looked for ways to improve HR processes. I also introduced and supported improvements, such as enhanced documentation and streamlined follow-up processes, to enhance efficiency and service delivery.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"comments\":\"Maintained clear and professional communication with employees, managers, and external partners. Listened to feedback, worked collaboratively across departments, and built positive working relationships based on trust, respect, and timely support.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"comments\":\"Maintained a high level of professionalism, reliability, and commitment to my responsibilities. Demonstrated consistent punctuality, met deadlines, and adhered to company policies and ethical standards while serving as a positive example to others.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"comments\":\"I set clear expectations for team members by delegating tasks, monitoring their progress, providing regular feedback and support to help them improve their performance. Held one-on-one discussions where needed and ensured team members understood their responsibilities and goals. Organised checkins and meetings so we can align on the overall departmental objectives.\",\"selfScore\":4,\"managerScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"comments\":\"Committed to continuous personal and professional development by enrolling in the CIPM professional certification program, participating in online courses, and attending mentorship programs and HR Communities. I actively seek feedback to improve my skills and apply new knowledge to enhance my effectiveness and contribute to the organization\'s goals.\",\"selfScore\":5,\"managerScore\":4,\"managerFeedback\":\"kindly list the specific courses you have done within the 6months. this list will be expected in the annual PFR\"}]','2026-07-28 17:17:05.000','I plan to complete my CIPM certification, continue taking HR courses and participating in mentorship programmes to strengthen my professional skills. I also aim to implement HR processes that are streamlined, policy compliance, introduce structured performance check-ins, improve workforce planning, and develop more effective learning and development programmes that add value to the organization. I will continue to seek feedback and opportunities to grow so I can contribute more strategically to the business.'),
('REV001HR003','HR003','Goldy Godfrey','HR 2 (HR Executive 2)','CYC001','2026 Mid-Year Performance Cycle','Submitted','I have improved the accuracy of employee data, completed onboarding on time, managed payroll processing, ensured training was held each month with good employee engagement, and managed IHS and In-house related matters.',NULL,NULL,2.8612499999999996,'[{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_15\",\"text\":\"Employee Grievance Resolution\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 2 (HR Executive 2)\"],\"description\":[\"Resolve 90% of employee grievances within 5 working days within the next 6 months\",\"Achieve a conflict resolution rate of 90% or better, with no unresolved conflicts lasting more than 30 days within the next 12 months\",\"Performance Management\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Most employees grievances have majorly been about salary payments and HMO, and these were addressed promptly.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_16\",\"text\":\"Performance Review Compliance\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 2 (HR Executive 2)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensuring 100% compliance regarding the quarterly performance review\",\"Execution of the result of the bi-annual performance appraisal on or before the 2nd week of the next half-year\",\"Recruitment and Retention\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"There were a few hiccups in closing out on recruitment in the last quarter due to the peculiarities of the role. \"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_17\",\"text\":\"Staff Turnover Reduction\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 2 (HR Executive 2)\"],\"description\":[\"Reduce the overall employee turnover rate to 10% or less within the next 12 months\",\"Time-to-Hire: Reduce average time (2months) taken to fill open positions within the next 12months\",\"Onboarding: Within one week of resumption\"],\"selfScore\":90,\"comments\":\"All onboardings were closed within one week.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_18\",\"text\":\"Confirmation Letter Distribution\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 2 (HR Executive 2)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure employees receive confirmation letters by the first week of the 7th month\",\"Payroll Management and Statutory Compliance\",\"Achieve a payroll accuracy rate of 99.5% or better, with no more than 0.5% errors in payroll processing within the next 6 months\"],\"comments\":\"All confirmed staff members received their letters promptly. \\nPayroll for each month was completed with accuracy and all statutory deductions were effected. \",\"selfScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_19\",\"text\":\"Statutory Payments & Payroll Processing\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 2 (HR Executive 2)\"],\"description\":[\"Ensure a monthly schedule of all (Pension, Tax, NSITF, etc.) statutory payments on or before the last day of every month\",\"Ensure submission of payroll approval for salaries on the 22nd of the month\",\"Ensure payment of monthly salaries on the 26th of the month for all staff and on the 24th for NBC\"],\"selfScore\":100,\"comments\":\"Except for a month or two where slight delays occurred, all salaries were paid as at when due.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_20\",\"text\":\"Employee Engagement & Satisfaction\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 2 (HR Executive 2)\"],\"description\":[\"Employee Engagement and Satisfaction\",\"Bi-annual Execution of Employee Satisfaction Survey – Timeline 3weeks\",\"Ensure 75% participation rate in the surveys\"],\"comments\":\"Feedback were sourced both formally and informally to ensure that employees\' are kept engaged and committed to the company. \",\"selfScore\":90},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_21\",\"text\":\"Employee Engagement & Satisfaction\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 2 (HR Executive 2)\"],\"description\":[\"Achieve an 75% engagement score by the end of the year\",\"Exit Management\",\"Average Time-to-Exit: Average time taken to complete the exit process\"],\"comments\":\"All formal resignations received were treated according to the Company\'s exit policy..\",\"selfScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_HUMAN_RESOURCES_22\",\"text\":\"Exit Process Completion Rate\",\"weight\":5,\"type\":\"objective\",\"departments\":[\"HR 2 (HR Executive 2)\"],\"description\":[\"Exit Process Completion Rate: Percentage of exit processes completed within a specified timeframe\"],\"comments\":\"I completed 100% of the process required for exiting staff members.\",\"selfScore\":100},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_1\",\"text\":\"Leadership and Accountability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Demonstrate responsibility and ownership of task outcomes\",\"Lead by example and guide colleagues\",\"Maintain accountability for deliverables\"],\"comments\":\"I ensure that all assigned tasks are completed within the stipulated time, and I take responsibility for any unexpected outcome. \\nMy relationship with colleagues is conducted with warmth and professionalism.\",\"selfScore\":4},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_2\",\"text\":\"Initiative and Perseverance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Take proactive steps to resolve issues without waiting for instructions\",\"Persist in overcoming obstacles and difficulties\",\"Seek continuous improvements in workflows\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I created folders for storing employees\' data digitally in a central drive for easy access. I constantly seek feedback from my line manager to help me improve my output.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_3\",\"text\":\"Communication and Interpersonal Ability\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Behavioural\",\"description\":[\"Communicate clearly and effectively with team members and stakeholders\",\"Listen actively and cooperate well with others\",\"Build constructive work relationships\"],\"selfScore\":5,\"comments\":\"I listen to understand and communicate with clarity.\"},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_4\",\"text\":\"Work Ethics and Attendance\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Culture\",\"description\":[\"Show high reliability and commitment to work tasks\",\"Maintain consistent punctuality and attendance\",\"Adhere strictly to corporate codes of conduct\"],\"selfScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_5\",\"text\":\"KPI Deployment for Team Members\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":[\"Clearly define and assign KPIs to direct reports\",\"Regularly monitor and evaluate team member performance\",\"Provide feedback and coaching to help team members achieve targets\"],\"selfScore\":5},{\"id\":\"OBJ_COMP_6\",\"text\":\"Self Improvement\",\"weight\":10,\"type\":\"competency\",\"expectedLevel\":4,\"category\":\"Self-Development\",\"description\":[\"Set personal development goals aligned with organizational objectives\",\"Actively seek feedback and opportunities to learn\",\"Complete training courses or obtain professional certifications\"],\"selfScore\":4}]','2026-07-16 15:13:31.000','Continue learning (attend webinars and training) that will improve my workflow.'),
